<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Mmats</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mmatsuwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ichitabu cha keli cha ighalawile mmatsuwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">MMATSUWA</para>
  <para style="is">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfili cha mwanduso na chakeli cha aghala ighalawile mna imiyaka umwande tsachiwa chitabu chimwe chikulu. Tsachanza ukugholeka chiwe pfitabu pfili ahala Ibibilia ya Chiyeburania hayanzile kwandikighwa kwa Chiyunani na kukemighwa Septuajinti. Iwanu wengi iwasomile wotoghola ghendo ka Ezira yuyo iyandike na ukutunga ichitabu cha mwanduso na chakeli cha aghala ighalawile mna ghamatsuwa, na ichitabu cha Ezira na Nehemiya. Imwandishi tsakasola simulitsi itsili mna pfitabu pfa samweli na wafalume hayandike ipfitabu apfino pfili. Iwanu wengi iwasomile pfipfila wotoghola ghendo ka pfitabu apfino tsapfandikighwa mna isusu ya keli ya ikaline ya tano, ng'ana Yesu yoneke baye, mna miyaka Ezira iyakalile mgima.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha mwanduso na chakeli cha aghala ighalawile mna imiyaka chakwanza kwa kutupetela silimulitsi tsa iwahenga wetu kwanzila Adamu mbaka Aburahamu na ukwanza kwa isi ya wanu wa Isiraeli mbaka ghamatsuwa ghala Waisiraeli hawoyile kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa. Kuya ichitabu choghendelela kutupetela isimo ya Waisiraeli kulawa haumalile utawala wa mfalume Sauli mbaka ukughwa kwa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Mna ichitabu chose, imwandishi kotulongela ing'anda ya Imulungu ili Yerusalemu. Daudi tsakeka pfinu pfa ukutsengela ing'anda ya Imulungu na solomoni imwanaghe tsakapfitsengele ing'anda ayo. Imwandishi pfipfila kotulongela apfila ing'anda ya Imulungu pfaihinyighwe na ipfinu pfake pfapfisolighwe. Mna imistali mili ya ichitabu cha keli aghala ighalawile mna ghamatsuwa imwandishi komalitsa kwa ukutolongela apfila ing'anda ya Imulungu pfaitsosengighwa keli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu cha keli</para>
  <para style="io">Isura 1-9 yotulongela apfila Solomoni, mfalume wa Isiraeli pfayakalile na pfayatawale</para>
  <para style="io">Isura ya 10-39 tsotulongela apfila iwanu wa isi ya Isiraeli na Yuda pfawagholeke na tsotulongela simulitsi tsa iwafalume iwatawale Yuda kulawa ghamatsuwa aghala mbaka wafalume pfawahumile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kolomba ihekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Selemani, mwanaghe mfalume Daudi, tsakema ghoya mna ufalume wake, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu tsakahamwe naye, tsakambaliki na kamtenda yawe mkulu ng'ani. <verse eid="2CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Mfalume Selemani tsakalonga na Waisiraeli wose, na pfilongotsi wose iwemilile maasikali elufu na iwemilile maasikali miya imwe, walamtsi, pfilongotsi wose wa Isiraeli na pfilongotsi wa tsikaya. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Kuya kawalaghitsa welongotse naye mbaka hanu ha ukutambikila ako Gibeoni. Kaghenda nawo ako kwaapfila ako tsakuna Lihema lienzeluke liyatengenetse Musa mtumighwa wa IMNDEWA ako kunyika. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Mfalume Daudi tsa ma kalighala Lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu kulawa Kiriati Yeriamu mbaka kuna Lihema lyayemitse ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Nayo imatsabahu ya shaba iyatendile Bezaleli, mwana wa Uri, na mtsukulu wa Huri, pfipfila tsaikala kuko Gibeoni hambele ha Lihema lienzeluke. Baho mfalume Selemani na iwanu wose wamlomba IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Selemani kagheluka kuchanya kuna imatsabahu ya shaba ikalile hambele ha Lihema lya IMNDEWA, na kalapfa wanyama elufu imwe wawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Chilo chicho Imulungu kamlawila Selemani, kamlongela, “Ulombe chinu chochose chaubama, na nene nitsokwing'a.” <verse eid="2CH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Selemani kamwidika Imulungu, “Ghweghwe kumtendela aba wangu uluso mkulu, kuya kunisaghula nene niwe mfalume, nikale hanu hake. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Lelo ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, ughatende ghose ghaumlongele aba wangu Daudi kutsomtendela. Kunitenda nene niwe mfalume wa iwanu awano iwali wengi ka timbwisi lya isi, <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />lelo nokulomba ungaye hekima na ukumanya, nidahe kuwalongotsa pfinoghile iwanu wako, kwaapfila yuhi ghendo iyodaha kuwalongotsa iwanu wako iwali wengi apfino?” <verse eid="2CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Imulungu kamwidika Selemani, “Kwaapfila ichinu achino chaulombile chilawa mmoyo mwako, naghwe ng'ulombile baye wing'ighwe tsimali, utajili na ukutunyighwa, wala ng'ulombile baye maadui tsako wakomighwe, wala ng'ulombile baye ukale mgima matsuwa mengi, lekeni kulomba hekima na ukumanya ili udahe kuwalongotsa pfinoghile iwanu wangu wanikwing'ile uwe mfalume wawo, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />nene nitsokwing'a ihekima na ukumanya. Kuya nitsokwing'a utajili, tsimali na ukutunyighwa kubita mfalume wowose wa ghamatsuwa ighabitile, na kubita iyatsakuwa mfalume ghamatsuwa ighakutsa.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri na uwetso wa mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1 Wafal 10:26-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Kuya Selemani koka hanu ha ukutambikila, ako Gibeoni, halikalile Lihema Lienzeluke, koya Yerusalemu. Kaitawala Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Selemani kaika hamwe imituka ikweghighwa na falasi na falasi. Tsakana mituka ya falasi elufu imwe na miya nne, na falasi elufu kumi na mbili, wayawekile mna imiji ya imituka ya falasi, na ako Yerusalemu kwayakalile yeye. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Mfalume Selemani tsakayongetsa ifetsa na inzahabu, iwa bwelele ka ghamabwe mna isi ya Yerusalemu, na tsimbao tsa mibiki ya mieletsi tsiwa nyingi ka mikuyu ikota hasi ha ipfidunda pfa Yudea. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Falasi wa Selemani tsawalawa Misiri na Kilikia, wachulutsi wake tsawawaghula kulawa kuko. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Mtuka ghumwe ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi waghughula kulawa Misiri kwa kilo saba tsa madini gha fetsa, na falasi yumwe tsakaghulighwa kwa kilo mbili tsa madini gha fetsa. Pfipfila nawo wawautsila imituka ayo na wafalasi wafalume wose wa Wahiti na wa Wasiria.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfitsotsengela ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1 Wafal 5:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Mfalume Selemani kalaghitsa itsengighwe ing'anda ya ukumtambikila Imulungu, na ing'anda yake ya chifalume. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Keka wamale elufu sabini wawe waduta mitsigho, na wanu elufu semanini wawe wasongola mabwe mpfidunda, na wamwenga elufu ndatu na miya sita wawe wemilitsi wawo. <verse eid="2CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Kuya Selemani katuma nume kwa Hiramu mfalume wa Tiro, kamlongela, “Unendele ka pfaumtendele aba wangu Daudi, ahala haumghalile mikataluba ya ukutsengela ing'anda ya ichifalume. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Lelo na habehi ukutsenga ing'anda ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu. Nitsoilapfa kwa IMNDEWA, nayo itsakuwa hanu ha ukudusulila ubani iunung'ila ghoya hambele hake, kuya hatsakuwa hanu ha pfighate pfa ukwikighwa hambele hake matsuwa ghose, na nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa nemitondo na nemihe, na mna ghamatsuwa gha Sabato, na mna ukudeng'elela kwa mlawo ghwa ghumwetsi, na pfihungo pfimwenga pfa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, ka pfayailaghitse Isiraeli ukutenda apfo matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="2CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Ing'anda yanibama ukutsenga itsakuwa ng'ulu ng'ani, kwaapfila Imulungu wetu kamkulu kubita milungu yose. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Lekeni angu nani iyodaha kumtsengela ing'anda ka kulanga kwenyegho ng'akumwenela baye, wala kuchanya kwa kulanga? Lelo nene nili nani mbaka nimtsengele ing'anda, ka si hanu hela ha ukudusulila ubani? <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Lelo ungalile munu iyomanya ukutengenetsa pfinu pfa nzahabu, pfa fetsa, pfa shaba, na pfa chuma na pfa tsinguwo tsa langi ya nzambarao na ndung'u na buluu, na iyodaha kwika unzolingo kwa ukwangula yasang'ane na iwanu wangu iwali muisi ya Yuda na Yerusalemu iwasaghulighwe na aba wangu Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Pfipfila ngalile mikataluba, miberoshi na misandali kulawa Lebanoni, kwaapfila nomanya iwanu wako wa isang'ano womanya sideke kwa ukubatsula tsimbao ako Lebanoni. Na iwanu wangu watseyapfila na iwanu wako, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />ili wanitulile mbao nyingi, kwaapfila ing'anda yanibama ukutsenga ng'ulu na ya ukukangawatsa. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Nitsoweng'a iwanu wako awala iwatula tsimbao, nitsolapfa tani elufu mbili tsa ingano idughighwe, na tani elufu mbili tsa shayiri, na lita laki nne dipfai, lita laki nne tsa mapfuta gha mitseituni.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Naye Hiramu, mfalume wa Tiro kamwidika Selemani kwa ibaluwa, kalonga, “Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawakunda iwanu wake, kakutenda uwe mfalume wawo. <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli, iyaumbile lilanga na isi! Kamwing'a mfalume Daudi imwana yana ihekima, na tsimbutsi, iyatsomtsengela IMNDEWA ing'anda, na iyatsetsengela imwenyegho ing'anda ya chifalume. <verse eid="2CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Lelo nokughalila munu iyokemighwa Huramu Abi, imunu iyadahile ukutengenetsa pfinu pfingi, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />yeye ka mwana wa pinga yumwe wa kabila lya Dani na aba wake yang'ali yokalagha Tiro. Ayo kamanya ghendo kutungenetsa pfinu pfa nzahabu, pfa fetsa, pfa shaba, pfa chuma, pfa mabwe, pfa mibiki, na pfa rangi ya nzambarao, buluu ndung'u na tsinguwo tsinzelu. Kuya kodaha ghendo kwika unzolingo na kukwangula chila chinu kwa kuwinzilitsa chinu chochose chayakwing'ighwa. Yeye katsosang'ana na iwanu wako, wanu wa imkulu wangu, Daudi aba wako. <verse eid="2CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />Lelo mkulu wangu, ipfinu apfo pfaulongile: ingano, ishayiri, ghamapfuta na idipfai, nokulomba upfighale kwa watumwa wako, <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />na twetwe tutsotula mbao kulawa ako Lebanoni ka pfaubama, kuya totsoha hamwe tsiyeluke mmatsi mbaka Yopa. Kulawa ako kutsotsighala Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Wafal 6:1-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Kuya mfalume Selemani kawapeta iwagheni wose iwakalile mna isi ya Isiraeli ka Daudi, aba wake pfayawapetile. Tsahana wanu wagheni laki imwe, elufu hamsini na ndatu, na miya sita. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Mna iwagheni awo, Selemani kasaghula wanu elufu sabini wawe waduta mitsigho, na wanu elufu semanini wasongole ghamabwe mpfidunda, na wanu elufu ndatu na miya sita wawemile wayawo ahala hawosang'ana ing'onde.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Kuya Selemani kanza kuitsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu mna ichidunda Moria ako IMNDEWA kwayamlawile Daudi, aba wake, hanu hayasaghule Daudi hana ichibwalu cha ukubetela ingano cha Orinani wa ilukolo lwa Yebusi. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Mfalume Selemani kanza ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu mna litsuwa lya keli na ghumwetsi ghwa keli ghwa ghumwaka ghwa kane ghwa ufalume wake. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Ing'anda Selemani iyamtsengele Imulungu tsaina utali wa futi tisini, na ughatsi wake futi salasini. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Na ichikuta cha ing'anda china utali wa futi salasini, ka pfauli ughatsi wa ing'anda, na utali wake kughenda kuchanya tsa futi miya imwe na semanini, mghati mwa ichikuta acho kakandika nzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Ichikuta ichikulu tsakachighubika na tsimbao tsa miberoshi na kachibakatsa inzahabu inoghile na kachola mibiki ya mitende na minyororo. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Mfalume Selemani kaihamba ing'anda ya Imulungu kwa ghamabwe ghanoghile gha bei ng'ulu. Inzahabu yaitumile tsailawa isi ya Parivaimu. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Kakandika nzahabu mna ing'anda yose, mna tsiboliti tsake na ipfitsingiti pfake, na imibanda yake na imilango yake. Kachola kwa ukukwangula pfiumbe ipfikemighwa makelubi mna ubanda wa ing'anda. <verse eid="2CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Kuya katenda hanu Haenzeluke ng'ani. Utali wake na ughatsi wake tsa futi salasini, kachikandika ichiheleto acho kwa nzahabu ya tani ishilini. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Misumari yaitumile tsaina utsito upfika nusu kilo ya nzahabu. Kuya kapfighubika pfiheleto pfose pfa kuchanya kwa nzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Kalaghitsa watengenetse pfinyagho pfibili pfa makelubi kwa tsimbao, kapfighubika kwa nzahabu na kapfika Hanu Haenzeluke ng'ani. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Chila chiumbe chikala china mabawa meli ghana futi kumi na tano. Bawa limwe lya futi saba na nusu tsaligusa ubanda umwe wa ichikuta, na libawa lya kabili lya futi saba na nusu ligusa libawa lya ichiumbe wa kabili. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Kuya libawa lya ichiumbe wa kabili tsaligusa chitala ubali ungi wa ichiheleto na lya kabili tsaligusa libawa lya ichiumbe wa mwanduso mghati mwa ichiheleto. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Utali wa ghamabawa ghose gha ipfiumbe awo weli tsaukala futi salasini. Wema aku wololesa ichikuta chikulu. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Naye katengenetsa panzia lya maghwanda matselu ighanoghile lidadatsighwe kwa nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u. Lipanziya alyo tsalihambighwa pfinoghile kwa pfiumbe wana ghamapamanilo iwokemighwa makelubi kwa tsinyutsi atso.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngutso mbili tsa shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Mfalume Selemani katengenetsa ngutso mbili tsa shaba, chila imwe chimo chake tsa futi ishilini na saba, katsika hambele ha ing'anda. Chila ngutso tsaina litwi mchanya mwake lina utali futi saba na nusu. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Katengenetsa mikufu, kuya kaika mchanya mwa tsingutso atso. Kuya katengenetsa pfinu ka ghamatunda gha makomamanga miya imwe, kapfika mna imikufu ayo. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Katsisimika tsingutso atso tsa shaba hambele ha hanu haukwingilila kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Ingutso isimikighwe ghumoko ghwa kujilo kaikema Yakini, na aila isimikighwe ghumoko ghwa kumoso kaikema Boazi.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Pfinu pfa Ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Mfalume Selemani katengenetsa imatsabahu ya shaba utali wake futi salasini, na ughatsi wake futi salasini na chimo chake futi kumi na tano. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Kuya kalubula shaba kafina bigha kulu ghendo ilikemighwe Bahari. Utali wake kughenda hasi libigha alyo tsa futi saba na nusu, na utali wake mwambu na mwambu tsa futi kumi na tano, na mtsunguluko ghwake futi alubaini na tano. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Hasi mwa ukingo wa libigha alyo tsawafina pfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wamale iwakalile mna misululo mili, ghumwe tsaghukala hasi na ghungi tsaukala uchanya. Wang'ombe awo tsawafinighwa hamwe na libigha alyo. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Libigha alyo likighwa mchanya mwa pfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wamale kumi na weli wa shaba, wadatu walola kasikazini, wadatu walola kusini, wadatu walola mashariki na wadatu walola maghalibi. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Unene wake tsa nchi ndatu, na mna ukingo wake libigha lighala na chikombe, ka luwa lya yungiyungi, na ling'ali likwingila lita ka elufu sitini tsa matsi. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Pfipfila tsakafina ipfiya pfa ukwopfughila tsinyama tsa tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Pfiya pfitano kapfika ubali we kusini na pfingi pfitano kapfika kasikazini ing'anda ya Imulungu mwa. Libigha alila kulu wang'ali wonawila iwatambika. <verse eid="2CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Kuya kafina pfigutso kumi pfa nzahabu pfa ukwikila pfitasa ka pfailaghitsighwe, kapfika mna chikuta chikulu cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, pfitano kapfika ubali wa kuisini na pfitano ubali wa kasikazini mwa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Kuya katengenetsa metsa kumi, natso katsika mna ichikuta cha ing'anda ya Imulungu katsika tano ubali wa kuisini na tano ubali wa kasikazini wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. Kuya katenda ghamabakuli miya gha nzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Katsenga luwa lwa mghati lwa iwatambika na luwa lungi lukulu wa kunze, na imilango ya iluwa iyaighubike ishaba. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Libigha alila kulu ilikemighwe bahari kalika hana imembe ili kusini mashariki mwa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huramu pfipfila kafina pfinongo, makoleo, na mabakuli gha kughidila. Apfi pfipfo pfayamalitse tsing'onde tsotse tsa ing'anda ya Imulungu tsayeng'ighwe na mfalume Selemani yatende, <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />tsingutso atsila mbili, ghamatwi meli ighali ka bakuli mchanya mwa tsingutso, na tsinyapfu mbili tsa ukuhamba ghamatwi agho meli ighali mchanya mwa tsingutso, <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />ipfinu ipfoneke ka ghamatunda gha makomamanga miya nne mna imisululo mili mna chila inyapfu imwe, ikighwe mchanya mwa ghamatwi ighali mchanya mwa tsingutso atso, <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />pfipfila katengenetsa matololi kumi, na pfia pfake kumi, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />na libigha alila likulu ilikemighwe Bahari, limile mna ipfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wamale kumi na weli, <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />kuya kafina pfinongo, makoleo na mabakuli. Ipfinu pfose apfino ipfili mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Huramu pfayamtengenetsele Selemani, tsa pfa shaba ikuwighwe. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Mfalume kalaghitsa ipfinu apfo pfifinighwe mnna ipfombo pfa lidongo lya widi mna ichiwala cha Yoridani, haghati ha Sukoti na Saretani. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Selemani ng'apfilingile baye utito wa ipfinu pfose apfino kwaapfila tsa pfingi ng'ani, apfo utito wa ishaba ng'aumanyike baye. <verse eid="2CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Pfipfila Selemani kafina pfinu pfa nzahabu pfiwe pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kafina matsabahu ya nzahabu, imetsa ya nzahabu ya ukwikila ipfighate ipfilapfighwa kwa Imulungu, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />pfigutso na pfitasa pfa nzahabu inoghile tsa ukulangatsila hanu ahala Haenzeluka Ng'ani ghendo, ka pfailaghitsighwe, <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />malumbo gh amaluwa, tsitala, na uma, apfo pfose tsa pfa nzahabu inoghile ghendo, <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />pfipfila kafina pfisahani, mikasi, masiniya gha ukudusulila upfumba, pfihali pfa ukuhalila ghumoto, ghumlango ghwa Hanu Haenzeluke Ng'ani, na ghumlango ghwa ichikuta cha ing'anda ya Imulungu. Apfo pfose tsapfinighwa kwa nzahabu inoghile.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Mfalume Selemani hayamalitse tsing'onde tsose tsa ukuitsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kapfighala ipfinu apfila aba wake Daudi pfayapfilapfile kwa IMNDEWA. Ipfinu apfo tsa fetsa, nzahabu, na pfinu pfingi, na kapfika mna ichiheleto cha ukwikila ipfinu mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanduku lyoghalighwa mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1 Wafal 8:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Kuya mfalume Selemani kawakema hamwe wanzehe wose wa Isiraeli na pfilongotsi wose wa ghamakabila ako Yurusalemu, na iwakulu wa tsikolo, wakalisole lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA kulawa Sayuni, Ghumji ghwa Daudi walighale kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wetingana kwa mfalume Selemani mna ghumsimu ghwa ichihungo, mna ghumwetsi ghwa Saba. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Iwanzehe wose wa Isiraeli hawapfikile, iwatambika wetwika lisanduku. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />Walawi na iwatambika tsawalighala mchanya lisanduku lya laghano na Lihema Iienzeluke na pfinu pfose ipfihenzeluke ipfikalile mwihema amwo. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Mfalume Selemani na mtingano ghwa Isiraeli wetingana hambele ha lisanduku lya lilaghano, kuya walapfa nambiko tsa wang'ombe na wang'olo wengi ing'awopetika baye. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Kuya watambika walingitsa lisanduku lya IMNDEWA hanu hake, mna ichiheleto cha mghati cha ing'anda, hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, walika hasi ha ghamabawa gha ipfiumbe apfila. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Ghamabawa gha pfiumbe awo tsaghatandatsighwa mchanya mwa hanu halikighwe lisanduku, apfo lisanduku na imibiki yake yaukulighalila tsaikala hasi mwe ghamabawa. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Kwaapfila mibiki yake ya ukulighalila tsaikala mitali ng'ani, kusa kwa imibiki ayo koneka kulawa hanu haenzeluke hambele ha ichiheleto cha mghati, lekeni ng'ayoneke baye kulawa ubali wa kunze. Imibiki ayo ya ukulighalila sanduku yabaho mbaka leloli. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Ng'akukalile na chinu chingi baye mghati mwa lisanduku, ila tsakuna ghamabamba meli gha ghamabwe ghayekile Musa akula Horebu, hanu IMNDEWA hayekile lilaghano na wanu wa Isiraeli hawalawile Misiri.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utunitso wa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Kuya iwatambika walawa hanu haenzeluka. Iwatambika wose iwakalile hala tsawetenda wela bila kulowa ghamakingili ghawo. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Walawi wose iwang'ali wakwimba, tsina Asafu, Hemani na Yedutuni na Walawi wangi wa kolo tsawo, aku wapfala maghwanda ghawo gha chitani chinoghile aku wakinda ghamatoatsi na pfing'weng'we na pfilimba wema ubali wa mashaliki mwa matsabahu. Watambika miya na ishilini iwatowa malati tsa wahamwe nawo. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Wemba aku wowinza midundo ya tsimalati, na matoatsi, na pfinu pfimwenga pfawotowa, tsawamtunya na wamlongela mighede Imulungu. Wemba kwa kukemelela walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 5:13">“Kwaapfila Yeye kanogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 5:13">na libatsi lyake lyokala ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Baho ing'anda ya Imulungu imema libingu. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Libingu alyo liwatenda iwatambika waleke kusang'ana, kwaapfila ukulu wa Imulungu tsaumema mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Selemani kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:12-21">1 Wafal 8:12-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Kuya Selemani kalonga, “IMNDEWA tsakalonga katsokala mna ichisi chitito. <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Lekeni nene nikutsengela ing'anda inoghile, hanu hako ha ukukala ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Aku iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wang'ali wema baho, mfalume Selemani kawahundukila kamlomba Imulungu yawabaliki. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Kuya kalonga, “Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kwaapfila kwa ingupfu yake katenda achila chayamlongele aba wangu Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />Tsakalonga, ‘Kulawa ghamatsuwa aghala haniwalapfile iwanu wangu mna isi ya Misiri, sighusaghule baye mji ghwoghwose mna ghamakabila gha iwanu wa Isiraeli itsengighwe ing'anda yakunitambikila nene, na wala simsaghule munu wowose baye yawe mfalume wa iwanu wangu Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Lekeni sambi nighusaghula ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu hawe hanu ha ukunitambikila nene, na nimsaghula Daudi yawe mfalume wa iwanu wangu Isiraeli.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />“Apfo aba wangu Daudi tsakabama yatsenge ing'anda yakumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Lekeni IMNDEWA tsakamlongela aba wangu Daudi, ‘Kwaapfila ichinu cha ukunitsengela nene ing'anda tsa cha mmoyo mwako, pfinogha kwa kubama ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Lekeni si ghweghwe baye yutsoitsenga, iyatsoitsenga ing'anda ayo imwanagho, imwana yutsomweleka ghumwenyegho.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“Lelo sambi IMNDEWA Imulungu katenda achila chayalongile, kwaapfila nene niwa mfalume hanu ha aba wangu Daudi, na nichikalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile, kuya nitsenga ing'anda ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Mng'anda amwo nika lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA lyayekile na iwanu wa isiraeli.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kolomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1 Wafal 8:22-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Kuya Selemani kema hambele ha imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA na hambele ha iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, kenula ghamako kuchanyana. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Selemani katsenga jukwaa lya shaba, utali wake na ughatsi wake tsa futi saba na nusu, na chimo chake futi nne na nusu. Kalika haghati ha ichibwalu. Kadina mchanya, katowa maghoti hambele ha iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, kenula ghamoko kulanga, <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />kalonga, Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kuduhu Imulungu yungi iyali ka ghweghwe, kulanga au muisi, Ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wa ukutogholighwa, kwaapfila kutenda laghano lyako lya ukuwakunda iwanu wako wose iwokala aku wokutegheletsa kwa ghumoyo ghwawo ghwose. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Kutenda achila chaumlongele aba wangu Daudi, kwa mlomo ghwako tsakulonga, na leloli kughatenda kwa uwetso wako. <verse eid="2CH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />Lelo ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, nokulomba pfipfila ughatende aghala ghaumlongele mtumwa wako aba wangu Daudi, ahala haulongile, ng'utsokala baye aku kwahela mtsukulu yumwe iyatsokalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli, ka iwatsukulu wako watsakwalangitsa mna chila chawotenda, ka ghweghwe pfautendile. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Lelo ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, nokulomba ghendo ughatende ghose ghumlongele mtumwa wako Daudi.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />Lekeni ghwe Imulungu, apfi ghendo ghweghwe kutsokala na iwanu amu muisi? Hata kulanga kwenyegho, wala kulang'a kuchanya ng'ani ng'akukwenela baye, angu ing'anda aino yaniitsengile itsokwenelatse? <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Hata apfo ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, Imulungu wangu, nene mtumwa wako nokulomba unitegheletse na ughatende ghose ghanikulomba leloli. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Uilolese ing'anda aino chilo na imisi, hanu hausaghule iwanu wako wakutambikile. Kuya unihulike nene mtumwa wako hanikutsa ahano kulomba. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Uhulike chanikulomba nene mtumwa wako na chawokulomba wanu wako Waisiraeli hawolomba aku wolola hanu hano. Uhulike aghala ghawolomba kulawa ako kulanga, kuya ung'ahulika uwaleghusile tsinzambi tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />Munu yang'amtendela totso miyaghe, naye yang'aghalighwa ili yelahe hambele ha imatsabahu yako mna ing'anda aino, yang'elaha, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />nokulomba ghweghwe uhulike kulawa ako kulanga, ulamle uwahighe iwatumwa wako. Imunu yana litotso umhighe kwa litotso lyake, imunu iyalihela totso umlekelele na umghweke kwaapfila kahela totso. <verse eid="2CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />Iwanu wako Waisiraeli hawotowighwa na maaduwi tsawo kwaajili ya tsinzambi tsawakutendele, nawo wang'atubu kuna ghweghwe na wang'alitoghola litaghwa lyako na wang'alomba uwalekelele tsinzambi tsawo mna ing'anda aino, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />uhulike kulawa ako kulanga, uwalekelele tsinzambi tsawo, kuya uwoyitse kuna isi yauweng'ile wawo na iwabala tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />Imvula ing'aleka kutowa kwaapfila wakutendela nzambi, wang'alomba aku wolola hanu ahano na wang'atoghola litaghwa lyako, kuya wang'atsileka tsinzambi tsawo, nokulomba, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />uwahulikitse kulawa kulanga, uwaleghusile tsinzambi tsawo watumwa wako, iwanu wako Waisiraeli, akuno kowalangulitsa wawinze inzila inoghile, kuya ukailekele imvula itowe mna isi yako aino yauweng'ile iwanu wako iwe mali yawo. <verse eid="2CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />Ka muisi mna nzala. au utamu wa tauni, au ukame, utamu wa mimeya, nzighe, au lung'wawa, au ka iwanu wako watsingilitsighwa na maaduwi tsawo mna ghumji ghwawo ghoghose aghula; ka hana janga lyolyose, au utamu wowose, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />chochose ichilombighwa na imunu wowose, au iwanu wako Waisiraeli, chila munu yang'amanya maghayo ghake na usungu wake, yang'akulomba aku kogholosa ghamoko ghake kuna ing'anda aino, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />uhulike kulawa kuko kulanga, uleghuse tsinzambi, kuya umtendele chila munu ka pfayobamighwa kutendelighwa, mana ghweghwe uliyeka yumanya ichikwalangulighwa na imimoyo ya iwanu wose, <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />ili wakupfuke na watsiwinze nzila tsako ghamatsuwa ghose hawokala mna isi yauweng'ile wabala wetu. <verse eid="2CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />Mgheni au imunu ing'ayolawila mghati mwa iwanu wako Waisiraeli hayatsokutsa kulomba mna ing'anda aino kulawa isi ya kutali kwaajili ya taghwa lyako kulu, na kwaajili ya ngupfu tsako na uwetso wako, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />nokulomba umuhulike kulawa ako kulanga umwing'e imgheni ayo chochose chayokulomba ili iwanu wose muisi mwose walimanye litaghwa lyako na wakuhulikitse ka pfawotenda iwanu wako Waisiraeli. Kuya wamanye ka ing'anda aino yaniitsengile yomanyika kwa litaghwa lyako. <verse eid="2CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />Wanu wako wang'aghenda kung'ondo kwitowa na maaduwi tsawo, kokose akula kwautsowaghala, nawo wang'akulomba aku wolola ghumji aghuno ghuusaghule, na ing'anda yaniitsengile kwaajili ya litaghwa lyako, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />nokulomba ako kulanga kwauli ughahulike aghala ghawokulomba, kuya uwatende wahume mna ing'ondo. <verse eid="2CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Wang'akutendela nzambi, mana kuduhu munu yang'ayotenda nzambi, kuya ung'awonela maya na kuwaleka watowighwe na maaduwi tsawo mbaka waghoghighwe na waghalighwe mna isi ya kutali au ya habehi; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />hawatsakuwa ako kutali, wang'akuyila kwa ghumoyo ghwawo ghose na kutubu na kukulomba uwaleghusile nzambi tsawo, wang'alonga, ‘Tukutendela nzambi, twetwe twagha ghendo, tutenda ighehile;’ <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />pfipfila wang'akuyila kwa ghumoyo ghwao ghose na muhe wao ghose hawatsakuwa isi ya kutali, kuya wang'alomba aku wolola akuno muisi yawo, isi yuweng'ile iwabala wawo, ghumji aghuno ghwaughusaghule, na ing'anda yaniitsengile kwaajili ya litaghwa lyako; <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />nokulomba ghendo ako kulanga kwauli uhulike aghala ghawolomba, uwaleghusile tsinzambi iwanu wako iwakutendile nzambi. <verse eid="2CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />Lelo ghwe Imulungu wangu, utulole ughabokele aghala ghatutsolomba hanu ahano.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />Lelo winuke ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:41">wingile hanu hako ha ukubwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:41">ghweghwe na lisanduku lya laghano lya ngupfu tsako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:41">Uweng'e ukombotsi iwatambika wako ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:41">wanu wako wadeng'elele ighanoghile. <verse eid="2CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Ghwe IMNDEWA uleke kumleka Mbakighwa mapfuta wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:42">Ukumbuke pfaumkundile mtumwa wako Daudi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Ing'anda yolapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Selemani hayamalitse ukulomba, ghumoto ghuhulumka kulawa kulanga, ghulakatsa ipfinu ipfilapfighwe na tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, kuya utunitso wa IMNDEWA umema mna ing'anda. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Na iwatambika ng'awadahile baye ukwingila mng'anda amwo kwaapfila utunitso wa IMNDEWA tsaumema mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Waisiraeli wose hawonile ghumoto ghohulumka kulawa kulanga na utunitso wa IMNDEWA umema mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, wenama mbaka ipfihanga pfawo pfidonza hasi, wamtambikila na kumlongela mighede IMNDEWA, walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 7:3">“Kwaapfila kanogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 7:3">libatsi lyake lyokala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 7:3">ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Baho mfalume Selemani na iwanu wose wamlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Naye Selemani kamlapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu ng'ombe elufu ishilini na mbili na ng'olo laki imwe na ishilini. Apfi pfipfo mfalume na Waisiraeli wose pfawaikile ing'anda iwe ya IMNDEWA Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Watambika wema hanu hawalaghitsighwe weme, Walawi nawo wema aku wana pfinu pfa ukumwimbila IMNDEWA pfayapfitengenetse mfalume Daudi pfiwe pfa ukumlongela IMNDEWA mighede. Kuya wemba, “Kwaapfila uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose,” ka Daudi pfayawalaghitse. Iwatambika nawo watowa tsimalati aku Waisiraeli wose wema wima.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Kuya mfalume kachitenda ichibwalu cha mghati cha ing'anda chitogholighwe na Imulungu, na baho yeye kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na tsa pfijo, na tsa ukukala tseghamba. Katenda apfo kwaapfila imatsabahu ya shaba ikalile hambele ha IMNDEWA tsandodo ukwenela tsinambiko tsose atso tsa ukulakatsighwa, tsa ipfijo, tsa ukukala tseghamba, na tsa ghamapfuta. <verse eid="2CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Apfo Selemani katenda chihungo, na kukala mtingano mkulu ghwa Waisiraeli wose na yeye kwa matsuwa saba, iwanu tsawalawa Lebo Hamati mbaka hana ilukolongo lwa Misiri. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Mna litsuwa lya nane waitenda imatsabahu itogholighwe na Imulungu, kwa matsuwa saba, na matsuwa ghangi saba wang'ali wodeng'elela ichihungo. Haghamalile matsuwa agho, wetingana hamwe wamalitsile ukudeng'elela. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Mna litsuwa lya ishilini na ndatu lya ghumwetsi ghwa saba, Selemani kawalekelela iwanu woke, na woka mmakaye mwao akuno wodeng'elela na kusangalamka mna imimoyo yawo kwa ghose ighanoghile IMNDEWA ghayamtendele imtumighwa wake Daudi na iwanu wake Waisiraeli.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu komlawila keli Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:1-9">1 Wafal 9:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Apfo mfalume tsakamalitsa ukutsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na ing'anda ya mfalume, kadaha ukughatenda aghala ghose ghayabamile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na ya mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlawila Selemani nechilo, kamlongela, “Ghaulombile nighahulika, nihasaghula hanu ahano hawe ing'anda yangu ya ukundapfila tsinambiko. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />Ning'awema imvula au ning'awaghalila nzighe waje imimeya yawo, au wang'apata utamu wihile, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />lekeni ka iwanu wangu watsehulumsa iwenyegho, wang'alomba na wang'anibama na kutsileka tsinzila tsawo, nene nitsowahulikitsa kulawa kulanga, nitsotsilekelela tsinzambi tsawo, na nitsoihonetsa isi yawo. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Lelo nitsoilolesa Ing'anda aino na kuhulikitsa ichilombighwa hanu ahano, <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />kwaapfila niisaghula na kuitenda yele ng'anda aino ili iwanu wangu wanitambikile ahano matsuwa ghose. Nitsoilolesa na kuikunda matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="2CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Naghwe ung'anitumikila pfinoghile ka pfayatendile aba wako Daudi, ung'atenda ghose ghanikulaghitse na kughateghelesa ghanikulongele, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />nene nitsoutenda ufalume wako uwe na ngupfu ka pfanilaghane na Daudi aba wako, ahala hanimlongele, ‘Ngutsoleka baye kuwa na imunu wa kutawala Isiraeli.’ <verse eid="2CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />Lekeni mng'aleka kuniwinza na kughaleka ghaniwalongeleni, na kughaleka ghamalaghitso ghaniweng'ile na kughenda kuitumikila milungu ingi na kuitambikila, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />nene nitsomng'olani kulawa isi yangu yaniweng'ile. Pfipfila ing'anda aino yaniitoghole kwa taghwa lyangu nitsoilema, nitsoitenda iwe si chinu baye na itsobetsighwa na iwanu wose. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Hata ka ing'anda aino sambi yotunyighwa ng'ani, chila munu iyatsobita ahano katsokangawala na ukwighutsa, ‘Hebali IMNDEWA kaitendela apfino isi aino na ing'anda aino ya Imulungu?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Iwanu watsakwidika, ‘Kwaapfila wamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa aba tsawo iyawalapfile Misiri, waiwinza milungu ingi, waitambikila na kuitumikila. Lelo IMNDEWA kawaghalila maghayo ghose aghano.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Sang'ano tsingi tsa Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Wafal 9:10-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Miyaka ishilini iyatumile Selemani ukutsenga Ing'anda ya Imulungu na ing'anda ya mfalume haimalile, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />kaitsenga keli imiji iyeng'ighwe na Huramu, kuya kaweng'a imiji ayo Waisiraeli wakale. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Hambele Selemani kaghenda Hamati Zoba, kaghuboka ghumji aghwo, <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />na kaghutsenga ghumji ghwa Tadmori ako kunyika, na katsenga tsing'anda tsa ukwikila ipfinu ako Hamati. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Pfipfila Selemani tsakaitsenga keli imiji aino: Beti Horoni ya uchanya na Beti Horoni ya kuhisi, imiji ina tsingome, imibanda na ghamalango ghana tsimalamingo, <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />ghumji ghwa Balati na imiji yake yose ina tsikano, imituka yake ya ukukweghighwa na ya wadina falasi wake, na chinu chochose chayabamile ukutsenga ako Yerusalemu, Lebenoni au hohose mna ufalume wake. <verse eid="2CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Iwanu wangi wose iwasighale kulawa mna Wahiti, Waamori, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi, na wose iwakalile si Waisiraeli baye, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />na iwana wawo iwalekile kukomighwa na Waisiraeli, Selemani kawatenda watumwa wa kusang'ana ng'onde tsa kunanahitsighwa, na apfo pfipfo pfawotenda mbaka leloli. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Lekeni kulawa mna Waisiraeli Selemani ng'amtendile baye munu wowose yawe mtumwa wa sang'ano tsake. Waisiraeli tsawawa maasikali, wamwenga wakulu wa maasikali wake, wakulu wa imituka yake ya ukukweghighwa, na wakulu wa wadina falasi wake. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Awano wawo iwakulu iwekighwe na mfalume Selemani: Iwakulu awo tsa miya mbili na hamsini iwang'ali wowemila iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Selemani tsakamghala neghe Farao mfalume wa Misiri kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kamghala kuna ing'anda iyamtsengele kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Mwehe wangu ng'atsokala mna ing'anda ya Daudi mfalume wa Isiraeli, kwaapfila hanu hohose halikalile lisanduku lya IMNDEWA, ihanu aho haenzeluka.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Selemani tsakamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa mchanya mwa imatsabahu iyamtsengele IMNDEWA hambele ha ichikuta cha ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Kalapfa tsinambiko atso ka pfailaghitsighwe na Musa chila litsuwa lya Sabato, pfihungo pfa mlawo wa ghumwetsi, na pfihungo pfidatu pfa chila mwaka, chihungo cha pfighate ing'apfighelighwe hamila baye, na chihungo cha majuma, na chihungo cha pfibumbulika. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Tsakaghawinza malaghitso gha Daudi, aba wake, kapanga nzamu tsa watambika wose, na tsa Walawi iwembile, na iwawapfile watambika kumtunya Imulungu na kutenda sang'ano tsawo. Kuya keka makingili gha wakalitsa imilango yose, kwaapfila apfo pfipfo pfayalaghitse Daudi, imunu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Nawo ng'awalekile baye ghayalaghitse mfalume kwa watambika na Walawi, hamwe na chinu chochose cha tsikano tsa ukwikila ipfinu.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Apfo pfinu pfayatendile Selemani tsapfitimila, kulawa halikighwe libwe lya ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA mbaka halimalile. Apfo ing'anda ya IMNDEWA imala. <verse eid="2CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Kuya Selemani kaghenda Esioni Geberi na Eloti iili kumwani mwa isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Huramu kamghalila tsimeli itsilongotsighwe na iwakulu wa maasikali wake na iwanu iwamanyile ghoya ibahari. Wawo na maasikali wa Selemani waghenda mbaka Ofiri, kulawa ako wasola nzahabu kilo elufu kumi na tano, wamghalila mfalume Selemani.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Malikia wa Sheba komwangila mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Wafal 10:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Malikia wa Sheba hayahulike ukumanyika kwa mfalume Selemani, kaghenda Yerusalemu yakamghetse Selemani kwa kumghutsa mbuli ng'omu ng'omu. Kelongotsa na wanu wengi, na ng'amia iwaghalile pfilungo ipfinung'ila, nzahabu ketseketse na mabwe gha bei ng'ulu. Hayapfikile kwa Selemani kalonga naye mbuli tsotse itsikalile mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Selemani kamwidika mbuli tsose, kuduhu chinu chochose chayang'adahile kumlongela. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Malikia wa Sheba hayonile ihekima ya Selemani na ing'anda yake iyatsengile, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />na hayonile ichijo ichikikwe mmetsa mwake, apfila iwakulu wake pfawakalile mmetsa, na apfila iwatumwa wake pfawapfalile, na iwatumwa iwoweng'a iwanu pfa ukunwa pfawapfalile na tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsayalapfile Selemani mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, kakangawala ghendo.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Apfo kamlongela mfalume, “Ghose ghanihulike muisi mwangu kwa mbuli tsa tsisang'ano tsako na ihekima yako, gholongesa! <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Lekeni sidahile baye kutoghola chawalongile mbaka hanipfikile na kwona nimwenyegho, lelo ghanongelighwe tsa chidogho ghendo, ihekima yako na ukulu wako pfobita pfose pfanihulike. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Wabweda iwanu wako! Pfipfila wabweda iwatumighwa wako, iwakwimagha hambele hako, na iwohulikitsa ihekima yako. <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, iyanoghelighwe naghwe na kukwika mna ichighoda cha ufalume, uwe mfalume, ukinde hanu ha IMNDEWA Imulungu wako, kwaapfila Imulungu wako kawakunda Waisiraeli na kuwemitsa ghamatsuwa ghose, kakwika ghweghwe uwe mfalume wawo ili ughendelele ukuhigha ghoya na ukutenda ipfibamighwa.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Kuya malikia kamwing'a mfalume nzahabu kilo elufu nne, na ipfilungo ipfinung'ila ghoya ketseketse na ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu. Ng'ana baye pfilungo pfingi ipfinung'ila ghoya ka apfo malikia wa Sheba pfayamwing'ile mfalume Selemani.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Pfipfila watumighwa wa Hiramu hamwe na wa Selemani iwaghalile nzahabu kulawa Ofiri, waghala mibiki ya mininga na ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Selemani tsakatumila imibiki ayo kutsengela tsingatsi tsa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na ing'anda ya mfalume, na katengenetsela pfinubi na pfing'weng'we pfa iwakwimba. Pfinu ka apfo ng'ana pfoneke baye mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Naye mfalume Selemani kamwing'a malikia chila chinu chayabamile, kamwing'a pfinu ketseketse kubita apfila pfayamghalile malikia. Kuya malikia koya muisi mwake aku kelongotsa na iwanu wake.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri wa mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1 Wafal 10:14-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Chila mwaka Selemani wamghalila nzahabu tani elufu ishilini na ndatu, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />bila ukutsipeta tsinzahabu tsayabokele kulawa kwa wachulutsi na kulawa kwa iwakulu wose wa isi ya Arabia na iwakulu wa Isiraeli iwamghalile nzahabu na fetsa. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Mfalume Selemani katengenetsa ngawo ng'ulu miya mbili, chila imwe tsaibakighwa nzahabu inoghile ka kilo saba. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Kuya katengenetsa ngawo ndodondodo miya ndatu, chila ngawo tsaibakighwa nzahabu ka kilo ndatu, kuya mfalume katsika mna ing'anda ya chifalume ikemighwe Ing'anda ya Muhulo ghwa Lebanoni.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Pfipfila mfalume katengenetsa chighoda chikulu ichikighwe unzolingo wa tsimembe tsa nembo, na kungi kachikandika nzahabu inoghile. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Ichighoda acho tsachina ngatsi sita na ichighoda cha nzahabu cha ukwikila ghamaghulu, pfose apfo tsapfikindilisighwa na ichighoda acho cha ufalume, na chila ubali tsachina hanu ha ukweghamila ghamoko, kuya tsachina pfinyagho pfili pfa simba habehi na hanu aho ha ukweghamila ghamoko. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Tsahana pfinyagho kumi na mbili pfa simba, na chila ngatsi tsawema weli akuno na akuno. Ichighoda ka acho tsang'ana chitengenetsighwe baye mna ufalume wowose.<verse eid="2CH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Pfikombe pfose pfa mfalume Selemani tsa pfa nzahabu, na ipfinu pfose ipfikalile mna Ing'anda ya Muhulo ghwa Lebanoni tsa pfa nzahabu inoghile. Tsakuduhu chinu ichitengenetsighwe kwa fetsa, mana fetsa tsayoneka si chinu baye mna ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Selemani. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Selemani tsakana meli itsighendile mbaka Tarishishi na watumighwa wa Huramu, na chila ing'abita miyaka midatu tsimeli atso tsatsuya aku tsomghalila nzahabu, fetsa, membe tsa nembo, hoko na pfideghe iwokemighwa tausi.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Apfo mfalume Selemani kawabita wafalume wose mna isi yose kwa mali na ihekima. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Wafalume wa isi tsose wang'ali wobama wamghendele Selemani wahulikitse ihekima yake iyeng'ighwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Chila mfalume kamghalila nzawadi atsino: pfinu pfa fetsa na pfa nzahabu, na maghwanda, na silaha, pfilungo ipfinung'ila ghoya, farasi na punda falasi. Tsayang'ali yobokelagha nzawadi atso chila mwaka.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Mfalume Selemani tsakana pfikwama elufu nne pfa ukwikila farasi na mituka, na maasikali iwodina falasi elufu kumi na mbili iyawekile mna imiji ina hanu ha ukwikila mituka ya falasi ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Tsakawatawala wafalume wose kwandusila mto Eufurati mbaka isi ya Wafilisti na mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Selemani tsakaitenda ifetsa yoneke chinu chidodo ka ghamabwe ighali Yeusalemu, na mibiki miyeletsi tsiwa ketseketse ka mikuyu ikota hasi ha ipfidunda pfa Yudea. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Falasi iwaghalighwe kwa Selemani tsawaghulighwa kulawa Misiri na kulawa isi tsingi tsose.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsigha kwa utawala wa Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Wafal 11:41-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Ghangi ghayatendile Selemani kulawa hayanzile mbaka hayamalitse ufalume wake ghandikighwa mna ipfitabu pfa “Mbuli tsa nabii Natani,” na mna “Unabii wa Ahiya wa Shilo,” na mna “Ghamaono gha Ido,” iyakona, pfipfila ighana tsimbuli tsa Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Selemani katawala isi yose ya Isiraeli kwa miyaka alubaini. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Kuya Selemani kahupa, kabwihila hamwe na iwahenga wake, wamtsika mna ghumji wa Daudi, aba wake. Rehoboamu imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gha kasikazini ighakemighwe Isiraeli ghomlema Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Kuya Rehoboamu kaghenda Shekemu kwawetingane Waisiraeli wose wamtende yeye yawe mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Naye Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati hayahulike ichinu acho tsayang'ali yokala Misiri kwayatsumile kumpfuka Selemani. Apfo koya kulawa Misiri. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Lekeni Waisiraeli watuma nume, wamkema yatse kuna wawo. Kuya yeye na Waisiraeli wose wamghendela Rehoboamu wamlongela, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Aba wako katutwika mtsigho mtito, lelo utuhungutsile ghumtsigho aghwo, na twetwe tutsokutumikila.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Rehoboamu kawedika, “Tanu ghendani, kuya haipfika ikacha mtse keli.” Apfo iwanu awo woka. <verse eid="2CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Kuya mfalume Rehoboamu kabama yawahulikitse iwanzehe iwang'ali womshauli Selemani aba wake, wolongatse mna imbuli ayo. Kawaghutsa, “Apfi mlongatse, niwedike choni iwanu awano?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Iwanzehe awo wamwidika, “Ung'awa mluso kwa iwanu awano na kuwanoghelesa, na ung'alonga nawo pfinoghile, watsakuwa watumighwa wako ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Lekeni Rehoboamu kalema chawamlongele iwanzehe, kaghenda kuwaghutsa iwasongolo wayaghe iwakulile naye na iwomsang'anila, <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />kawaghutsa, “Angu mwemwe mlongatse ili tuwedike iwanu awano iwanongele, ‘Tuhungutsile mtsigho ghwayatutwikile aba wako?’ ” <verse eid="2CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Iwasongolo awala iwakulile hamwe naye wamwidika, “Walongele iwanu awo iwalongile, ‘Aba wako katutwika mtsigho mtsito, utuhungutsile ghumtsigho aghwo’, naghwe walongele apfino, ‘Ichidole changu chidoghodogho chinene kubita ichuno cha aba wangu. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Aba wangu kawatwika mwemwe mtsigho mtsito, lekeni nene nitsakongetsa ghuwe mtsito ng'ani. Aba wangu kawafapulani kwa mbalati, lekeni nene nitsowafapulani kwa mijeleledi ya mihonga.’ ” <verse eid="2CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Mna litsuwa lya kadatu Yeroboamu hamwe na iwanu wake wose woya kwa Rehoboamu ka pfayawalaghitse. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Naye mfalume Rehoboamu kaghabetsa ghawamlongele iwanzehe, kawedika kwa kuwakembela iwanu awo, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />kulingana na achila chawamlongele iwasongolo hawalongile, “Aba wangu kawatwika mtsigho mtsito, nene nitsoghutenda ghuwe mtsito ng'ani. Aba wangu kawafapula kwa mbalati, lekeni nene nitsowafapula kwa mijeledi ina imihonga.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Apfo mfalume ng'awategheletse baye iwanu awo, kwaapfila ichinu acho tsachighalighwa na IMNDEWA ili yaitimitse imbuli yake iyamlongele Yeroboamu, mwana wa Nebati kubitila Ahiya imunu wa ghumji ghwa Shilo. <verse eid="2CH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Waisiraeli wose hawonile mfalume kalema kuwategheletsa, wamwidika apfino: “Tuna choni kwa mfalume Daudi, na tuna chochose cha ukupata kwa mwana wa Yese? Lelo mke kuna ghamahema ghenu, mwemwe Waisiraeli, ilolese ing'anda yako ghumwenyegho, ghwe Daudi.” Apfo Waisiraeli woka kuna ghamahema ghawo. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Lekeni Waisiraeli iwang'ali wokala mna imiji ya Yuda, Rehoboamu yang'ali yowatawala. <verse eid="2CH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Kuya mfalume Rehoboamu kamtuma Hadoramu iyakalile mkulu wa tsisang'ano tsa ukunanahitsighwa, lekeni Waisiraeli wamtowa kwa mabwe, wamkoma. Baho mfalume Rehoboamu kadina ghumtuka ghwake katsumila Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Apfo iwanu wa ghamakabila gha kaskazini Isiraeli walema ukutawalighwa na ilukolo lwa Daudi mbaka leloli.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Unabii wa Shemaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehoboamu hayapfikile Yerusalemu, kawakema hamwe maasikali laki imwe na elufu semanini kulawa mna likabila lya Yuda na lya Benjamini, iwadahile ukwitowa pfinoghile, waketowe na wanu wa Isiraeli, ili woyitse keli ufalume kwa Rehoboamu mwanaghe Selemani. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Lekeni imbuli ya IMNDEWA imtsila Shemeya munu wa Imulungu, ilonga, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Mlongele apfino Rehoboamu mwana Selemani mfalume wa Yuda na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli iwokala mna isi ya Yuda na Benjamini, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />nene IMNDEWA nolonga, ‘Mleke kughenda kwitowa na ndughu tsenu, kwaapfila chinu achino chilawa kuna nene.’” Kuya wategheletsa mbuli ya IMNDEWA, woya mmakaye, ng'awaghendile baye kwitowa na Yeroboamu.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboamu koitsengela ubanda imiji ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboamu kakala Yerusalemu na katsenga ubanda kutsunguluka imiji ikalile mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Kaitsengela imiji ya Betilehemu, Etamu, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beti Suri, Soko na Adulamu, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />na Gati, Maresha, Zifu, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />na Adoraimu, Lakishi, Aseka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />na Sora, Ayaloni na ghumji ghwa Hebroni. Aino iyo imiji itsungulutsighwe ubanda mna isi ya Yuda na Benjamini. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Kaitenda imiji ayo itsilungulitsighwe ubanda, kuya keka wakulu wa Maasikali mna chila umji, aku katsenga tsikano tsa ukwikila ipfijo, ghamafuta gha mitseituni, na tsa dipfai. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Pfipfila keka tsingao na imigoha mna imiji yose, na kuitenda imiji ayo iwe na ngupfu ghendo. Apfo iwanu wa Yuda na Benjamini walongotsighwa naye.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatambika na Walawi wohamila Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Watambika na Walawi wose kulawa kuna ghmakabila gha kasikazini ya Isiraeli yose, tsawawa chinu chimwe na Rehoboamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Walawi tsawaleka mighunda yawo ya ukudimila na mighunda yawo ingi, waghenda Yuda na Yerusalemu kwaapfila Yeroboamu na iwanaghe tsawawaghoma wawo waleke kusang'ana ing'onde ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Yeroboamu tsakawasaghula watambika wake imwenyegho wasang'ane mna tsimatsabahu tsitsengighwe hanu henulighwe wakapfitambikile ipfinyagho ipfighala na wamene na iwana wa ng'ombe. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Wanu wose wana imimoyo ibama kumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kulawa makabila ghose gha kasikasini ya Isiraeli, waghenda na Walawi mbaka Yerusalemu wakamlapfile nambiko IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Apfo wautenda ufalume wa Yuda uwe na ngupfu, na kwa miyaka midatu tsawautoghola utawala wa Rehoboamu mwanaghe Selemani, nawo tsawima ghendo, kuya tsawakala ka pfawakalile mna ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Daudi na ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Selemani.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaye ya Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboamu tsakakwela pinga iyakemighwe Mahalati, neghe Yeremoti, ayu Yeremoti tsa mwana wa Daudi. Mai wake tsakakemighwa neghe Eliabu, mwana wa Yese. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Naye Mahalati tsakamwelekela wana wadatu. Yeushi, Shemaria na Zahamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Hambele Rehoboamu kamkwela Maaka, neghe Absalomu, naye kamwelekela iwana wamale wane, Abiya, Atai, Ziza na Shelomiti. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboamu tsakakwela wehe kumi na nane na mapinga wa kunze sitini, tsakana wana wamale ishilini na nane na wana mapinga sitini. Mna wehe wake wose awo na mapinga wake wa kunze, tsakamkunda sideke Maaka neghe Absalomu. <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboamu tsakamsaghula Abiya, mwana wa Maaka, yawe chilongotsi wa ndughu tsake, kwaapfila tsakabama ukumtenda yawe mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rehoboamu katenda kwa ukukengela ahala hayawapwilise iwanaghe wangi mna isi yose ya Yuda na Benjamini, kaweka mna imiji yose itsungulusighwe ubanda. Kawa mluso kuna wawo, pfipfila kawakwelela mapinga wengi.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Maaskali wa Wamisiri woipfamila Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1 Wafal 14:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Ufalume wa Rehoboamu hawimile ghoya na kuwa na ngupfu, yeye hamwe na Waisiraeli wose tsawaleka kughawinza malaghitso gha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Kwaapfila ng'awamtegheletse baye IMNDEWA, Shishaki, mfalume wa Misiri kaghutsingila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mna ghumwaka ghwa tano ghwa ufalume wa Rehoboamu. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Katsa na mituka elufu imwe na miya mbili na wadina falasi elufu sitini na maasikali wengi kulawa Libiya na Sukii na Kushi ing'awopeteka baye, wayelongotse nawo kulawa Misiri. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Mfalume Shishaki kaisola imiji ya Yuda itsungulusighwe ubanda, mbaka kapfika Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Baho nabii Shemaya kamghendela mfalume Rehoboamu na iwakulu wa Yuda iwetingane ako Yerusalemu kwawatsumile kumpfuka Shishaki, kawalongela, “IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfi, ‘Mwemwe mndeka nene, na nene nimlekani mna ghamoko gha Shishaki.’ ” <verse eid="2CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Baho mfalume na iwakulu wa Isiraeli wona achila ichihile chawatendile, walonga, “IMNDEWA kotenda ihaki.” <verse eid="2CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />IMNDEWA hayonile watanga chawatendile, kalonga keli na nabii Shemaya, kamlongela, “Kwaapfila watoghola ghehile ghawatendile, sitsowakoma baye, lekeni nitsowakombola chidogho Sitsakona maya baye na kuihinya Yerusalemu kubitila Shishaki, <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />lekeni watsakuwa watumwa wa Shishaki, nawo watsomanya ghendo kumbe pfinogha kunitumikila nene kubita kuwatumikila wafalume wa isi tsingi.” <verse eid="2CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Apfo mfalume Shishaki wa Misiri kaghupfamila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, kasola pfinu pfose pfili mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na pfinu pfose pfili mna ing'anda ya mfalume. Kasola chila chinu, hamwe na tsingao tsa nzahabu tsayatendile mfalume Selemani. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Apfo mfalume Rehoboamu katengenetsa ngawo tsingi tsa shaba hanu ha atsila tsa nzahabu itsisolighwe, kuya kaweng'a iwakalitsi wakulu watsibetetse, awala iwang'ali wokalitsagha lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Chila mala mfalume hayaghendile kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu, iwakalitsi watsikinda tsingawo atso, na hambele watsuyitsagha kuna ichiheleto cha iwakalitsi. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Kwaapfila Rehoboamu tsakehulumsa, IMNDEWA naye kaleka ukumghudubukila na ng'amkomile baye. Pfipfila mna isi ya Yuda chila chinu chighenda ghoya.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsigha kwa utawala wa Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Apfo mfalume Rehoboamu tsakema ghoya mna ufalume wake ako Yerusalemu. Tsakanza kuitawala isi ya Yuda aku kana miyaka alubaini na ghumwe, na katawala miyaka kumi na saba kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ghumji ghuyasaghule IMNDEWA kulawa ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli, ghuwe hanu ha ukumtambikila yeye. Na mai wake kakemighwa Naama, munu wa Amoni. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehoboamu tsakatenda ghehile, kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwake ng'aghumbamile baye IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Ghose ghayatendile mfalume Rehoboamu kulawa hayanzile mbaka hayamalitse ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha nabii Shemaya, na nabii Ido, tsaghandikighwa kwa ukulola tsikolo. Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu wang'ali wetowagha matsuwa ghawo ghose. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Kuya Rehoboamu kafa, wamtsika mna ghumji ghwa Daudi, na Abiya imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Abiya na Yeroboamu wetowa ng'ondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Abiya kanza kuitawala isi ya Yuda mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa mfalume Yeroboamu kuiatawala isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />Katawala kwa miyaka midatu ako Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Maaka, neghe Urieli wa Gibea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Kuya tsakulawila ng'ondo, Abiya ketowa na Yeroboamu. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiya kaghenda kung'ondo aku kana maasikali laki nne iwadahile ukwitowa, naye Yeroboamu kaghenda na maasikali wake laki nane iwadahile kwitowa. <verse eid="2CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Mfalume Abiya tsakema kuna chidunda cha Semaraimu, mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, kamkemela Yeroboamu na wanu wa Isiraeli, “Unitegheletse ghwe Yeroboamu na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Apfi ng'ammanyile baye ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, tsakeka laghano ing'alibeneka baye na Daudi ka wafalume wose watsolawila mna ilukolo lwake? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Lekeni Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, mtumwa wa Selemani, mwana wa Daudi tsakenuka na kumbiduka imkulu wake. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Kuya kawakema mahenze henze wawe naye, nawo wamlema Rehoboamu mwana Selemani, wambama yatende aghala ghawobama wawo, naye ng'adaile baye kuwalemela kwaapfila tsayangali msongolo na yang'ali yowapfuka. <verse eid="2CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />Sambi mwoghamba mwodaha kuulema ufalume wa IMNDEWA uli mna ghamoko gha iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Daudi, kwaapfila mna maasikali wengi na mna pfinyagho pfa nzahabu pfa imwana wa ing'ombe pfayatengenetse Yeroboamu pfiwe milungu yenu. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Angu mwemwe ng'amuwawingile baye iwatambika wa IMNDEWA, awala iwana wa Aruni, na iwana wa Walawi, kuya mwisaghulila wenyegho watambika wenu ka pfawotenda iwanu wa isi tsingi? Munu wowose iyakutsa yetende yele aku kana mwana we ng'ombe na wang'olo saba kodaha kuwa mtambika wa pfinu ipfikoneka milungu yenu. <verse eid="2CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />Lekeni kuna twetwe, IMNDEWA, yuyo Imulungu wetu, wala ng'atumlekile baye. Iwana wa Aruni wawo iwomtambikila IMNDEWA, na iwana wa Walawi wawo iwowapfila. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Chila mitondo na mihe, wawo womlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukupfukitsa ubani iunung'ila ghoya, kuya wakwika pfighate mna imetsa ya nzahabu inoghile, pfighate ipfikwikighwa hambele ha Imulungu, na wotuwa pfitasa ipfili mna ichinala cha nzahabu chila mihe. Apfo twetwe twoghawinza ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, lekeni mwemwe mumleka. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Lelo mlole, Imulungu mwenyegho kahamwe na twetwe, yeye kachilongotsi wetu. Watambika wake ma wakinda malati tsawo kututowela twanze ing'ondo na mwemwe. Mwemwe wanu Isiraeli wa makabila gha kasikazini, mleke kwitowa na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu. Ng'amdaha baye kuhuma!” <verse eid="2CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Lekeni Yeroboamu tsakawatuma maasikali wake wawatsingile kwa kuchughu maasikali wa Yuda, aku maasikali wake wangi wawatsila kwa hambele. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Iwanu wa Yuda hawahunduke, wona maasikali wakuchughu kwawo na wangi wahambele hawo. Wamlilila IMNDEWA na watambika watsitowa malati tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Baho maasikali wa Yuda wakemelela lukemo lwa ng'ondo. Iwanu wa Yuda hawang'ali wokemelela, Imulungu kamtowa Yeroboamu na wanu wose wa Isiraeli hambele ha Abiya na Wayuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Wanu wa Isiraeli wawatsuma iwanu wa Yuda, naye IMNDEWA kawaghogha na kawatenda wanu wa Yuda wahume. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya na maasikali wake wawatowa ghendo Waisiraeli, tsawawakoma maasikali laki tano wa Isiraeli iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Apfo iwanu wa Yuda wahuma mna ing'ondo ayo, na wanu wa Isiraeli tsawatowighwa ghendo, kwaapfila iwanu wa Yuda tsawamlolela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo. <verse eid="2CH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiya na maasikali wake wamuwinga Yeroboamu, kuya tsakamboka imiji yake, Beteli na pfijiji pfake na Yeshana na pfijiji pfake, na Efuroni hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha Abiya, Yeroboamu ng'apatile ngupfu keli baye, kuya IMNDEWA kamtowa, naye hambele kafa. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Lekeni Abiya tsakaghendelela kuwa na ngupfu. Tsakakwela mapinga kumi na wane, na tsakana wana wamale ishilini na weli na wana mapinga kumi na sita. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Aghala ghangi ghayatendile Abiya mna utawala wake, ghayatendile na ghayalongile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha “Isimo cha nabii Ido”.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Asa kowatowa Waesiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Kuya Abiya tsakafa, katsikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kuya Asa, imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake. Mna ghamatsuwa gha ufalume wa Asa, isi tsakali yahela ing'ondo kwa miyaka kumi. <verse eid="2CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa tsakatenda ighanoghile na ighomnoghelesa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Katsihinya tsimatsabahu tsa chigheni, kabomola hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi, kaghatula ghamabwe gha kutambikila na kapfigana ipfinyagho pfa Ashera. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Kawalaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda wambameghe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo, na kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Pfipfila kabomola hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila na tsimetsa tsa ukudusulila upfumba mna imiji yose ya Yuda. Kuya tsakakala tseghamba mna ghamatsuwa gha ufalume wake. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Katsenga imiji itsingulutsighwe ubanda mna imiji yose ya Yuda mna ghamatsuwa agho ghayakalile tseghamba. Tsakuduhu munu iyetowile naye mna imiyaka ayo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakamleka yabwihile. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Kawalongela wanu wa Yuda, “Leka tuitsenge imiji aino, kuya tuitsungulusile ubanda na mumo tutsenge iminala, na twike ghamalango ghana tsimalamingo. Isi ing'ali yetu kwaapfila tughatenda aghala ghayobama IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, na sambi twokala kwa kubwihila.” Apfo watsenga, na hambele wabweda. <verse eid="2CH 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa tsakana maasaikali laki ndatu kulawa mna likabila lya Yuda wana tsingao na imighowa, na maasikali laki mbili na samanini kulawa mna likabila lya Benjamini wana tsingao na tsiminde. Wose awo tsa maasikali iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya. <verse eid="2CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Zera, Mwesiopia tsakaitowa isi ya Yuda aku kelongotsa na maasikali laki imwe na mituka miya ndatu, tsawaghenda mbaka Maresha. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Asa kalawa kaghenda kwitowa naye. Wose weli na maasikali wawo wema mna misululu yawo kwa ukwitowa mna ulwanda lwa Sefata habehi na Maresha. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Baho Asa kamlilila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, kuduhu yungi ka ghweghwe iyodaha kuwapfila iwalihela ngupfu, wetowe na iwana ingupfu. Utwapfile ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, mana twokuhuwila ghweghwe, na kwa taghwa lyako tutsa kwitowa na iwanu awano iwali wengi. Twapfile ghwe IMNDEWA, ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wetu, uleke kumleka imunu yakuhume.” <verse eid="2CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />IMNDEWA kawatowa Waesiopia hambele ha Asa na hambele ha iwanu wa Yuda. Na Waesiopia watsuma. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa na iwanu wake wawawinzilitsa mbaka Gerari, wawakoma Waesiopia wengi ng'ani, kuduhu hata yumwe iyadahile kwima keli yetowe, tsawatowighwa na IMNDEWA imwenyegho na iwanu wake. Iwanu wa Yuda tsawawaboka pfinu bwelele. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Wapfihinya pfijiji pfose pfili mmbalimbali mwa Gerari, kwaapfila iwanu iwakalile mna imiji ayo tsawampfuka IMNDEWA Imulungu. Maasikali wasola pfinu pfingi pfinoghile kulawa mna imiji ayo. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Maasikali wawatowa iwadimi, wasola wang'olo wengi na ngamia. Kuya woya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Asa kowoyitsa keli iwanu kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu kamtsila Azaria mwanaghe Obedi, <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />naye kaghenda kumbokela Asa, kuya kamlongela, “Unihulikitse, ghwe mfalume Asa na iwanu wose wa Yuda na Benjamini, IMNDEWA kahamwe na mwemwe, ka namwe mtsakuwa hamwe naye. Mng'ambama mtsomwona, lekeni mng'amleka, naye katsomlekani. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Kwa matsuwa mengi, wanu wa Isiraeli tsawakala aku wahela Imulungu iyolongesa, wala watambika wakuwafunda, wala ghamalaghitso, <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />lekeni hawapatile ghamaghayo, wawo wamuyila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, wambama, kuya wamwona. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho isi ng'aikalile tulu ghendo baye, kwaapfila tsakuduhu munu iyadahile ukwingila au ukulawa aku kamgima, iwanu wose wa isi ayo wang'ali woghaya sideke. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Isi imwe ing'ali itowa na isi ingi, mji ghumwe ghung'ali ghwitowa na mji ghungi, kwaapfila Imulungu yang'ali yowatenda waghaye na waghanzike. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Lekeni mwemwe mgangamale, wala mleke kutenyuka, kwaapfila mtsoghwekighwa kwa tsisang'ano tsamtenda.” <verse eid="2CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Asa hayahulike tsimbuli atsino tsa unabii wa Azaria mwana wa Obedi, ghumoyo ghwake ghupata ingupfu. Kapfibomola ipfinyagho pfose ipfidesa ipfili mna isi yose ya Yuda na Benjamini na kulawa mna imiji yose iyaibokile mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Efremu. Kuya kaitsenga keli imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA ikalile hambele ha ichibwalu cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Asa kawakema hamwe iwanu wose wa Yuda na Benjamini, na iwanu wangi iwang'ali wokala muisi mwake, kulawa Efuremu, Manase na Simeoni, awo tsawamtsila hawonile ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake kahamwe naye. <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Wose wetingana Yerusalemu mna ghumwetsi ghwa kadatu mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tano ghwa utawala wa Asa. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Mna litsuwa alyo wamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ng'ombe miya saba, na ng'olo na mene elufu saba kulawa mna wanyama iwawabokile iwoyile nawo. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Kuya watenda laghano ka watsomtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga tsawo kwa ghumoyo ghwose na kwa muhe ghwawo ghwose. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Na imunu wowose iyoleka kumhilikitsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yakomighwe, yawe msongolo au mnzehe, yawe mmale au ipinga. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Welighita kwa IMNDEWA kwa litsi kulu, kwa kukemelela aku wotowa talumbeta na malati. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Iwanu wose wa Yuda wadeng'elela sideke, kwapfila tsawelaha kwa ghumoyo ghwao ghwose. Wambama Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghose, kuya wampata. Naye IMNDEWA kawaleka wakale tseghamba chila ubali. <verse eid="2CH 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Asa pfipfila kamlapfa Maaka, mai wake, mna ulongotsi wa umalikia kwaapfila tsakatenda chinyagho ichidesa cha Ashera. Asa kachibena na kuchihondahonda na kuchilakatsa ichinyagho acho mna lwanda lwa Kidroni. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Hata apfo ng'ahahinyile baye hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi mna isi ya Isiraeli, lekeni yeye kaghulapfa ghumoyo ghwake ghose kwa IMNDEWA mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghayakalile mgima. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Kapfuyitsa ipfinu mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, apfila aba wake pfayapfilapfile kwa Imulungu, na apfila pfayapfilapfile yeye mwenyegho kwa Imulungu, tsakoyitsa fetsa, nzahabu, na pfombo pfingi. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Tsakuduhu keli ng'ondo, mbaka mna ghumwaka ghwake ghwa salasini na tano ghwa ufalume wa Asa.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s">Isi tsa Yuda na Israeli tsesonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na sita ghwa ufalume wa Asa, mfalume Baasha wa Isiraeli kaitowa isi ya Yuda, kuya katsenga ubanda utsunguluke ghumji ghwa Rama, ili munu wowose yaleke kulawa wala kwingila mna isi ya mfalume Asa wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Baho mfalume Asa kasola fetsa na nzahabu itsikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na ing'anda yake ya chifalume, katsighala Damaski kwa mfalume Beni Hadadi, mfalume wa Shamu, aku katuma nume, kamlongela, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Nobama twilaghane, nene na ghweghwe, ka apfila aba wangu na aba wako pfawelaghane. Lola, nokughalila nzahabu na fetsa, ili laghano lyawikile ghweghwe na Baasha mfalume wa Isiraeli litsighe na yeye yawalapfe asikali wake kuna nene woke.” <verse eid="2CH 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Beni Hadadi kamtogholela mfalume Asa, kawatuma wakulu wa maasikali wake wakaitowe imiji ya Isiraeli. Waghusola ghumji ghwa Iyoni, na ghwa Dani, na ghwa Abeli Beti Maaka, na ghwa Kineroti, na miji yose ya Nafutali ina tsikano tsa ipfijo. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Mfalume Baasha hayahulike tsimbuli atso, kaleka kughutsenga ghumji ghwa Rama, na kaileka isang'ano ayo. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Mfalume Asa kawakema hamwe iwanu wose wa Yuda, wakadute ghamabwe na mibiki kulawa Rama, iyang'ali yotsengela Baasha. Kuya mfalume Asa kasola ghamabwe agho na imibiki ayo katsengela ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Geba, na ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Mispa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabii Hanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Ghamatsuwa agho, nabii Hanani, kamghendela mfalume Asa wa Yuda, kamlongela, “Kwaapfila tsakwihuwila mfalume wa Shamu, kuleka ukwihuwila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, maasikali wa Shamu waswekuka kulawa kuna ghamoko ghako. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Angu awala Waesiopia na Walibiya tsang'awawile na maasikali wengi baye, na tsang'awawile na mituka na wadina falasi wengi baye? Lekeni kwaapfila tsakwihuwila IMNDEWA, naye tsakaweka mna ghamoko ghako.” <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />IMNDEWA kololesa pfinoghile ghendo mna isi yose, iyalanguse ingupfu yake kwa awala iwalapfile imimoyo yawo kumlolela yeye. Ghweghwe kutenda chinu cha ubotsi ghendo, apfo kulawa sambi kutsakuwa na ng'ondo chila mala. <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Imbuli ayo imtenda Asa yamwonele maya ng'ani nabii Hanani, apfo kamwoha mna ligeletsa. Na mna ghamatsuwa ghagho Asa kanza kuwadununza ghendo iwanu wamwenga.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa ufalume wa Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Ghayatendile Asa kulawa hayanzile mbaka hayamalitse, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda na Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na tisa ghwa ufalume wake, Asa kapata utamu wa ghamaghulu. Hata ka ghamaghulu ghang'ali ghomtama ng'ani, Asa ng'abamile baye IMNDEWA yamwapfile, lekeni kawabama iwaghanga wamwapfile. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Kuya Asa kafa mna ghumwaka ghwa alubaini na ghumwe wa ufalume wake. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Katsikighwa mna likabuli liyalisongole imwenyegho mna libambalawe ako kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Wamwika mna lisanduku limemile pfilungo ipfinung'ila ghoya pfa chila aina, kuya wabwina moto mkulu sideke kwa ukutambula ukulu wake.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati kakuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Imwanaghe Asa iyakemighwe Yehoshafati kawa mfalume, kasola hanu ha aba wake, kawatenda maasikali wake wawe na ngupfu ili yekinge na Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Kaweka maasikali wake wakale mna imiji yose ya Yuda itsingulusighwe ubanda, mna isi yose ya Yuda, na mna imiji ya Efuraimu iyaibokile Asa, aba wake. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />IMNDEWA kakala hamwe na Yehoshafati kwaapfila mna miyaka yake ya mwanduso tsakatenda aghala ghayatendile Daudi, sekulu wake, ng'amtambikile baye mulungu Baali. <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />Yeye kamtumikila Imulungu wa aba wake na kaghakinda ghamalaghitso ghake, wala ng'atendile baye aghala ghawatendile iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />IMNDEWA kautenda ufalume wa Yuda uwe na ngupfu mna ghamoko gha Yehoshafati, na iwanu wose wa Yuda wang'ali womghalila nzawadi, apfo tsakawa na mali nyingi na tsakana ukulu. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Ghumoyo ghwake tsaghubama ghendo kumsang'anila IMNDEWA, kubita agho ghose, yeye katsibomola tsimatsabahu itsikalile hanu henulighwe hose ha ukutambikila milungu ingi na ipfinyagho pfa Ashera, imulungu pinga, mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Mna ghumwaka wa kadatu ghwa ufalume wake, Yehoshafati, kawatuma iwakulu awano wakawafunde iwanu iwokala mna imji ya Yuda, tsakamtuma Beni Haili na Obadia na Sakaria na Netanaeli na Mikaya. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Pfipfila tsawelongotsa na Walawi tisa na iwatambika weli. Walawi awo tsa Shemaya, Netania, Sebadia, Asaheli, Shemiramoti, Yehonatani, na Adoniya na Tobia na Tobu Adoniya, na iwatambika awo tsa Elishama na Yehoramu. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Tsawachisola chitabu cha ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, wanga nacho mna imiji yose ya Yuda aku wowafunda iwanu.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />IMNDEWA kawaghela wogha wafalume wose iwali habehi na Yuda, wapfuka ukwitowa na Yehoshafati. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Wafilisti wangi wamghalila Yehoshafati nzawadi hamwe na fetsa bwelele, na Warabu wangi nawo wamghalila wang'unzu elufu saba na miya saba na mvulati elufu saba na miya saba. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Apfo Yehoshafati kaghendelela kuwa mkulu ghendo. Katsenga ubanda na imiji ina hanu ha ukwikila pfinu. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Kuya kakala na pfinu pfingi mna imiji ayo ili Yuda. Naye keka maasikali wengi iwadahile ukwitowa ako Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />na aghano ghagho ghamataghwa ghawo kwa kulola kolo tsawolawa aba tsawo: Adina tsa chilongotsi wa makingili gha maasikali wa likabila lya Yuda. Tsakawalongotsa maasikali laki ndatu. <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Wa kabili kwa ukulu tsa Yehohanani, yeye tsakalongotsa maasikali laki mbili na elufu semanini, <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />na wakadatu tsa Amasa mwanaghe Sikiri iyalongotse maasikali laki mbili. Amasa tsakelapfa mwenyegho ghendo kumsang'anila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Chilongotsi wa makingili gha maasikali iwalawile mna likabila lya Benjamini tsakakala Eliada, imunu iyakindike, naye tsakalongotsa asikali elufu mbili wakindile tsiminde na ngawo. <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Yawinzile Yehozabadi iyalongotse maasikali laki imwe na elufu semanini iwakalile ghoya kwa ukwitowa kwing'ondo. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Iwanu wose awo tsawamsang'anila mfalume ako Yerusalemu, na kubita agho ghose mfalume tsakeka maasikali wangi mna imiji ila itsungulusighwe ubanda mna isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Mikaya komkanya Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda tsakana mali na yang'ali yomanyika sideke, naye keka laghano na Ahabu wa mfalume wa Isiraeli, kabama imwanaghe yamkwele neghe Ahabu, mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Miyaka chidogho haifosile Yehoshafati kaghenda Samaria kumwangila mfalume Ahabu. Ahabu kamchinjila wang'olo na wang'ombe bwelele hamwe na iwanu iyelongotse nawo, kuya Ahabu kamdedetsa yaghende naye kughutowa ghumji ghwa Ramati Gileadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli kamghutsa Yehoshafati mfalume wa Yuda, “Pfihi kutsoghenda hamwe na nene kwighutowa ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi?” Yehoshafati kamwidika Ahabu, “Nene na ghweghwe twa chinu chimwe, Maasikali wangu ka maasikali wako. Tutsakuwa hamwe naghwe mng'ondo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Kuya Yehoshafati kaghendelela kumlongela mfalume wa Isiraeli, “Lekeni tanu umghutse IMNDEWA yolonga choni.” <verse eid="2CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Lelo mfalume Ahabu kawakema hamwe manabii wose iwopfika miya nne, kawaghutsa, “Pfihi ng'ende kughutowa ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi au ndeke kughenda?” Nawo wamwidika, “Ghenda, IMNDEWA katsokutenda uhume.” <verse eid="2CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Lekeni Yehoshafati kaghutsa, “Angu ahano haduhu nabii wa IMNDEWA yatudaha kumghutsa?” <verse eid="2CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Naye mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli kamwidika Yehoshafati, “Kabaha yumwe iyakalile, ayo twodaha kumghutsa IMNDEWA kubitila yeye, taghwa lyake Mikaya mwana wa Imla, lekeni nene nomwihila kwaapfila ng'olonga chinu chochose baye chinoghile mna nene, lekeni yeye kalongagha ghehile ghaliyeka.” Yehoshafati kedika, “Ng'apfinoghile baye mfalume yalonge apfo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Baho Ahabu kamkema mtumighwa wake yumwe kamlongela, “Ngalileni Mikaya mwana wa Imla sambi baha.” <verse eid="2CH 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Apfo mfalume wa Isiraeli na mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda wakala mna ipfighoda pfawo pfa ufalume hana ichibwalu cha ukubetela aku wapfala maghwanda ghawo gha chifalume, hana lilango lya ghumji, lya ukwingilila Samaria, na manabii wose wang'ali wotabiri hambele hawo. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Naye Sedekiya mwana wa Kenaana, yumwe wa manabii, tsaketengenetsela membe tsa chuma, kalonga, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Kwa tsimembe atsino kutsowoyitsa kuchughu Wasiriya mbaka wakomighwe.’ ” <verse eid="2CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Na awala manabii wamwenga wose wang'ali wolonga chinu chicho, walonga, “Ghenda ukaghutowe Ramoti Gileadi, na IMNDEWA katsokwapfila umtowe mfalume wake.” <verse eid="2CH 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Na imsenga ayula iyaghendile kumkema Mikaya, kamlongela, “Lola, manabii wose wolonga mfalume katsowatowa maaduwi, naghwe nokulomba utende ka wawo, utabili ighanoghile kuna yeye.” <verse eid="2CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Lekeni Mikaya kamwidika, “Neleha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, nitsomlongela chichila chayonongela IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="2CH 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Mikaya hayapfikile, mfalume kamghutsa, “Pfihi tughende tukaghutowe ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi au tuleke kughenda?” Naye kamwidika, “Ghenda naghwe kutsoghutowa, IMNDEWA katsokwapfila ughutowe ghumji aghwo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Nikutenda wilahe mala ngapi ili haulonga na nene kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA ulonge igholongesa?” <verse eid="2CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Kuya Mikaya kamwidika, “Niwona Waisraeli wapwililika mpfidunda ka wang'olo iwalihela mdimi, na IMNDEWA kalonga, ‘Iwanu awano wahela munu wa ukuwalongotsa, mleke chila munu yoke tseghamba ukaye yake.’ ” <verse eid="2CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Baho mfalume wa Isiraeli kamlongela Yehoshafati, “Kwakona? Nene sikulongele baye ka yeye ng'alongagha ghanoghile baye kuna nene ila ighehile ghaliyeka?” <verse eid="2CH 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Kuya Mikaya kalonga, “Lelo tegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA: Nimwona IMNDEWA kakala hana ichighoda chake cha ufalume akuno malaika wema kujilo kwake na kumoso kwake. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Naye IMNDEWA Imulungu kaghutsa, ‘Nani yatsombugha Ahabu yaghende yakakomighwe ako Ramoti Gileadi?’ Baho ayuno kolonga apfino, na yungi kolonga apfino. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Kuya muhe yumwe kema hambele ha IMNDEWA, kalonga, ‘Nene nitsombugha.’ IMNDEWA kamghutsa, kwa nzila yachi? <verse eid="2CH 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Naye kedika, ‘Nitsoghenda na kwitenda muhe wa ughutsu na kuwatenda manabii wake wose walonge ughutsu’ Imulungu kamlongela, ‘Ghweghwe kutsodaha ukumbugha, ghenda ukatende apfo.’<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Apfo lelo, IMNDEWA kawatenda manabii wako wose walonge ughutsu. IMNDEWA kalonga ghehile ghakupate.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Baho Sedekiya mwana wa Kenaana, kamsoghelela Mikaya, kamtowa mwikanza kuya kamghutsa, “Muhe wa IMNDEWA yalawiletse yandeke nene yatse kulonga na ghweghwe?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaya kamwidika, “Alyo kutsomanyalimanya mna litsuwa hautsakwingila wipfise mna ichiheleto chili mghati.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Ahabu kalaghitsa, “Msoleni Mikaya mmuyitse kwa Amoni, mkulu wa ghumji, na kwa Yoashi, mwana wa mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Kuya walongeleni wamwohe mwigelatsa, na wamwing'e chighate chidogho, na ghamatsi mbaka nene hanikuya mgima.”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Mikaya kalonga, “Ka kwakuya mgima, IMNDEWA ng'alongile na nene baye.” Kuya kaghendelela kulonga, “Mwemwe wanu wose mghakumbuke aghano!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1 Wafal 22:29-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Apfo mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli na mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda wagheluka waghenda Ramoti Gileadi kughutowa. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Mfalume Ahabu kamlongela Yehoshafati, “Hanighenda ukwitowa nene nitsopfala magwanda ghangu ghangi ili ndeke kwoneka ka nene mfalume, lekeni ghweghwe pfala magwanda ghako gha chifalume.” Apfo mfalume wa Isiraeli kaghenda kung'ondo aku kapfala magwanda ghangi.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Mfalume wa Siriya tsakawalaghitsa iwakulu wa ing'ondo iwemilile imituka ya ukukweghighwa na falasi, kawalongela, “Mleke ukwitowa na munu wowose ayula, yawe mdodo au mkulu, mwemwe mumtowe mfalume wa Isiraeli yaliyeka.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Iwakulu wa ing'ondo hawamwonile Yehoshafati walonga, “Ayuno mfalume wa Isiraeli ghendo.” Apfo wahunduka waghenda wakamtowe, lekeni Yehoshafati hayakemelele, IMNDEWA kamwapfila. Imulungu kawaghala kutali waleke kumsoghelela. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Nawo wakulu wa ing'ondo hawatangile ka yeye si mfalume wa Isiraeli baye, waleka ukumuwinzilitsa. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Lekeni iasikali yumwe kasa mshale kamhoma mfalume wa Isiraeli bila kumanya hanu halilunga ligwanda lyake lya chuma. Ahabu kamlongela iyakwendesa ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa, “Yuitsa ghumtuka ghwako kuchughu, undapfe akuno kung'ondo, miyagho wandagha pfihile.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Ing'ondo tsaighendelela mna imisi yose. Naye mfalume wa Isiraeli yang'ali yolebela mna ghumtuka ghwake aku kowalola maasikali wa Aramu. Nemihe litsua haling'ali likuswa, kafa.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Yehu komkembela Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda koya aku kamgima mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Lekeni nabii Yehu mwana wa Hanani, kaghenda kumbokela mfalume, kamlongela, “Angu kwakona pfinogha kuwapfila iwanu wehile, na kuwakunda awala iwomwihila IMNDEWA? Lelo imaya ya IMNDEWA ikutsila kwa aghala ghautendile. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Lekeni hata apfo kwinagho chidogho ighanoghile ghautendile, ghweghwe tsakupfilapfa ipfinyagho pfa Ashera, mulungu pinga, na tsakughulapfa ghumoyo ghwako ghose ghumbame Imulungu.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati kosaghula Walamutsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Mfalume Yehoshafati kakala Yerusalemu, lekeni yang'ali yowangilagha iwanu kwanzila Beeri Sheba ya kuisi mbaka kuna isi ya ipfidunda ya Efuraimu. Tsakatenda apfo ili yawoyitse iwanu kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Kasaghula walamtsi mna imiji yose ya Yuda itsungulusighwe ubanda, <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />kawalongela apfino, “Mwalangitse ghendo hamuhigha, kwaapfila ng'amuhigha baye ka pfawobama iwanu, lekeni mwohigha ka apfila pfayobama IMNDEWA, iyokala hamwe namwe hamhigha. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Apfo lelo mpfukeni IMNDEWA, na hamuhigha mwalangitse kwaapfila kuna yeye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu kuduhu ghendo ukubunza, wala kuduhu ukulola ichihanga cha munu na ukubokela hongo.” <verse eid="2CH 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Pfipfila ako Yerusalemu Yehoshafati kasaghula Walawi wamwenga, watambika na wakulu wakolo tsose tsa Waisiraeli wawe walamlitsi, wawahigheghe iwanu iwoleka kukinda ghamaghitso gha IMNDEWA, na wahigheghe ghamaghomba gha iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Tsakawalaghitsa apfino, “Mtende sang'ano tsenu kwa ukutogholighwa, na kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghose, aku mwompfuka IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Wandughu tsenu wose kulawa mna imiji yawokala hawowaghalilani ghamaghomba, ghawe gha ukukoma au gha ukuleka kukinda ghamalaghitso au gha ukuleka kukinda imiko, malamutsi, mwemwe muwakanye waleke kumtendelela nzambi IMNDEWA. Mng'aleka kutenda apfo, imaya yake itsowatsila mwemwe na ndughu tsenu, lekeni mng'atenda sang'ano tsenu pfinoghile ng'amtsototsa baye. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Amariya, mtambika mkulu, yeye katsolongotsa sang'ano tsose tsa IMNDEWA, naye Zebadia mwana wa Ishimaeli, mkulu wa kabila lya Yuda katsolongotsa sang'ano tsose tsa mfalume, na Walawi watsakuwa wakulu wenu. Meleke kutenda kwa kupfuka, na IMNDEWA yakale hamwe na awala wose iwotenda pfinoghile.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati kowahuma Waedomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Hambele, Wamoabu na Waamoni na Wameuni wamwenga watsa kwitowa na Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Iwanu wamghendela Yehoshafati, wamlongela, “Maasikali wengi iwolawa Edomu, kumwambu mwa ibahali ya Shamu watsa wetowe na ghweghwe. Sambi wapfika Hazazoni Tamari.” Kuya hanu aho litaghwa lyake lingi Eni Gedi. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Yehoshafati tsakapfuka, kamlomba IMNDEWA yamlongotse. Tsakawalongela iwanu wose wa Yuda waleke ukuja. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Iwanu wa Yuda tsawetingana hamwe wamlombe IMNDEWA yawapfile, watsa ghendo kulawa mna chila ghumji wambame IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Yehoshafati kema mna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wa Yerusalemu na wa Yuda, hambele ha iluwa lwa sambi lwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />kalomba kwa litsi kulu, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wetu, angu ghweghwe si Imulungu baye iyokala kulanga? Ghweghwe kwa mfalume wa tsifalume tsose tsili muisi; tsingupfu na uwetso pfammoko mwako, na kuduhu munu iyodaha kwima yetowe naghwe. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Ghweghwe Imulungu wetu yuwawingile iwanu iwakalile mna isi aino hambele ha iwanu wako Isiraeli na kuweng'a iwana wa sale yako Abrahamu iwe isi yawo ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Nawo wakala amwo, na wakutsengela ing'anda yako kwa ukulitambikila litaghwa lyako, aku wolonga, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Maghayo ghang'atutsila, ghawe gha ing'ondo, au gha utamu, au gha nzala, tutsakutsa twime hambele hako hana ing'anda yako aino itsengighwe tukutambikile, tutsokulilila apfila pfatughaya, naghwe kutsotuhulika na kutukombola.’ <verse eid="2CH 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />Lelo iwanu wa Amoni na Moabu na wa ichidunda cha Seili, iwanu awala yuwaghomile wahenga wetu waleke kutsitowa isi tsawo hawalawile Misiri, apfo wahenga wetu tsawabita kutali waleka kuwakoma, <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />ulole lelo apfila pfawotuliha! Wakutsa kutulapfa mna isi yako yautwing'ile iwe yetu. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Ghweghwe kwa Imulungu wetu! Angu ng'utsowahigha baye? Kwaapfila twetwe twahela ngupfu ya kwitowa na maasikali wengi awano iwotutsila. Ng'atumanyile baye choni cha ukutenda, lekeni tsinenge tsetu tsokulola ghweghwe utwapfile.” <verse eid="2CH 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Iwamale wose wa Yuda na wehe wawo na iwana wawo tsawang'ali wema baho hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Baho muhe wa Imulungu kamtsila Mlawi yumwe iyakalile baho, taghwa lyake Yahazieli mwana wa Zakaria, mwana wa Benaya, mwana wa Yeieli, mwana wa Matania, wa lukolo lwa Asafu. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Yahazieli kalonga, “Nitegheletse mfalume Yehoshafati, na iwanu wose wa Yuda, na iwanu wose wa Yerusalemu! Imulungu komlongeleni apfino; ‘Mleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka ghumoyo kwaapfila pfawali na maasikali wengi. Ing'ondo aino si yenu baye, ila yakwake yeye Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Ilupfi mhulumke mghende mkawatowe ahala hawatsogheluka kubitila hana ing'alo ya Zizi. Mtsetingana nawo akula kwachitsighila ichiwala habehi na inyika ya Yerueli. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Ng'ambamighwa baye kwitowa mna ing'ondo aino. Mwemwe mwime hela, kuya mbete, na mtsakona apfila IMNDEWA pfayatsowakombola. Mwemwe muwanu wa Yuda na muwanu wa Yerusalemu, mleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka ghumoyo. Ghendani mketowe nawo ilupfi, naye IMNDEWA katsakuwa hamwe namwe!’” <verse eid="2CH 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Baho mfalume Yehoshafati kawinamitsa uhanga wake mbaka hasi, na iwanu wose wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu wenamitsa ipfihanga pfawo hasi wamtamanila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Nawo Walawi wa lukolo lwa Kohathi na Kora wema na kumwimbila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kwa kulapfa litsi kulu ng'ani. <verse eid="2CH 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Ilupfi yake walamka lupfipfili, waghenda mbaka hana inyika ya Tekoa. Hawanzile ghumwanza, Yehoshafati kema kawalongela, “Mniteghelese mwemwe muwanu wa Yuda na muwanu wa Yerusalemu! Mumtoghole IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, namwe mtsakwima ghendo. Muwatoghole manabii wake, namwe mtsobweda!” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Yehoshafati hayamalitse ukulonga na iwanu, kawasaghula iwanu walongole hambele ha waasikali wamwimbile IMNDEWA na wamtunye yeye kwaapfila pfayenzeluke na pfayanoghile. Tsawemba apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 20:21">“Mumlongele Imulungu mighede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 20:21">kwaapfila kotukunda matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Hawanduse ukwimba na ukumtunya, IMNDEWA kaghala iwaasikali wake wawatowa iwanu wa Amoni na wa Moabu na wa chidunda Seiri iwatsile kwitowa na Yuda tsiweghele, nawo watowighwa. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Wanu wa Amoni na wanu wa Moabu wawatowa wanu wa chidunda Seiri, nawo wawakoma ghendo. Hawamalitse ukuwakoma iwanu wa ichidunda cha Seiri wandusa kwikoma wenyegho kwa wenyegho. <verse eid="2CH 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Iwanu wa Yuda hawapfikile hanu ha ukulolesela kunyika, walola akula kwawakalile maasikali wengi, na wona ng'uli tsa iwanu tsiwasa hasi. Kuduhu munu wowose iyahonile. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Apfo Yehoshafati na maasikali wake waghenda kuboka pfinu pfawo, ako wona tsimali, na maghwanda, na pfinu pfingi pfinoghile. Waduta ipfinu apfo kwa matsuwa madatu, lekeni ng'awapfimalitse baye, kwaapfila tsapfingi sideke. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Tsuwa lya kane wetingana mna ulwanda lwa Beraka, kuko wamtunya IMNDEWA. Apfi pfipfo pfaili kwa ulwanda alwo kukemighwa lwanda lwa Beraka, mana yake tsibalaka mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Iwanu wose wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu aku wolongotsighwa na Yehoshafati, woya Yerusalemu aku wodeng'elela, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakawapfila ukuwatowa maaduwi tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Hawapfikile Yerusalemu, walumbilila mbaka kuna Ing'anda ya IMNDEWA aku wotowa pfinanda na pfing'weng'we na malati. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Wafalume wose wa tsiisi wengila wogha hawahulike IMNDEWA pfayawatowile maadui wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Apfo ufalume wa Yehoshafati ukala tulu ghendo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamleka yabwihile mna chila ubali.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa ufalume wa Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1 Wafal 22:41-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Yehoshafati tsakana miyaka selasini na tano hayawile mfalume wa Yuda, na katawala aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka ishilini na tano, na mai wake tsakakemighwa Azuba neghe Shilihi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Katenda ighanoghile ghayatendile Asa aba wake, na ng'aghalekile baye, katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Lekeni chila hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila ng'ahahinyile baye. Iwanu ng'ana wahunduke baye na kumtambikila Imulungu wa iwahenga tsawo kwa mimoyo yawo yose. <verse eid="2CH 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yehoshafati tangiya hayanzile mbaka ufalume wake haumalile, ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha Yehu mwana wa Hanani, ighali mna ichitabu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Hambele, Yehoshafati mfalume wa Yuda kelaghana na Ahazia mfalume wa Isiraeli, iyatendile ghehile sideke. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Wepatana ukutengenetsa naye tsimeli tsa ukughenda Tarishishi, Watsitengenetsela ako Ezioni Geberi. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Lekeni Eliezeri mwana wa Dodafahu iyolawila ghumji ghwa Meresha tsakamtabilia Yehoshafati, tsakalonga, “Kwaapfila kwilaghana na Ahazia, IMNDEWA katsotsibena meli tsose tsamwitengenetsele.” Kuya meli atso tsibenekabeneka, apfo ng'atsidahile baye kughenda Tarishishi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Kuya Yehoshafati kafa, katsikighwa hanu hawatsikighwe iwahenga wake kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi naye Yehoramu, imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yehoramu kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:17-24">2 Wafal 8:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Yehoramu tsakana wadodo tsake sita, iwanaghe Yehoshafati, Azaria, Yehieli, Zekaria, Azariahu, Mikaeli na Shefatia. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Aba wawo tsakaweng'a nzawadi bwelele tsa fetsa, na tsa nzahabu, na tsa pfinu pfingi pfa bei ng'ulu, tsakaweng'a na imiji ya Yuda itsungulusighwe ubanda. Lekeni kamwing'a ufalume Yehoramu kwaapfila yeye tsa mwanaghe chaudele. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Yehoramu hayakalile mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume na ufalume wake hawimile, kawakoma ndughu tsake wose, pfipfila kawakoma iwakulu wangi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoramu tsakana miyaka salasini na mili hayawile mfalume, naye kaitawala Yuda kwa miyaka minane aku kokala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Kwaapfila tsakamkwela neghe Ahabu, kawinza nzila tsihile tsa iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Ahabu na wafalume wangi wa Isiraeli. Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'abamile baye kulukoma ilukolo lwa Daudi kwa lilaghano lyayekile na Daudi ka ghamatsuwa ghose kutsakuwa na munu kulawa mna ilukolo lwa Daudi iyatsotawala. <verse eid="2CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha Yehoramu iwanu wa Edomu walema kutawalighwa na mfalume wa isi ya Yuda, wamwika mfalume wawo wenyegho. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Apfo Yehoramu na ipfilongotsi wa maasikali na mituka yake yose ya ukukweghighwa waghenda Edomu. Kuko maasikali wa Waedomu wawapfingilila yeye na maasikali wake, lekeni nechilo katsuma. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Apfo isi ya Edomu ilema kutawalighwa na isi ya Yuda mbaka leloli. Matsuwa ghagho pfipfila iwanu wa Libina nawo walema kutawalighwa naye kwaapfila Yehoramu tsakamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wake. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Kuya katengenetsa tsimatsabahu tsa hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi mna ipfidunda pfa Yuda na kawahonza iwanu wa Yerusalemu waitambikile milungu ingi na kawaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Nabii Eliya kamghalila mfalume Yehoramu baluwa ilonga apfino, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa mhenga wako Daudi, kolonga apfino, ‘Ghweghwe ng'utendile baye ka pfayatendile aba wako Yehoshafati, au sekulu wako Asa, mfalume wa Yuda, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />ila kutenda ka pfawatendile wafalume wa Isiraeli. Kuya kuwalongotsa iwanu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu waitambikile milungi ingi ka pfawatendile wanu wa lukolo lwa Ahabu. Kuya kuwakoma ndughu tsako ghumwenyegho, iwanu wa ng'anda ya aba wako, iwanu iwanoghile kubita ghweghwe. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Lelo IMNDEWA katsowatowa iwanu wako, na iwanagho, na wehe tsako, na kutsihinya mali tsako tsose. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Ghweghwe ghumwenyegho kutsoghula utamu wihile wa munda chila hakukucha, mbaka utamu awo utende usapi wako ulawe kunze.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Imulungu kawatenda Wafilisti na Waarabu iwakalile habehi na Waesiopia wamwonele maya Yehoramu na wetowe naye. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Apfo waipfamila isi ya Yuda, wasola mali tsose itsikalile mna ing'anda ya mfalume, kuya wawaghogha iwanaghe wose na wehe tsake, ila Ahasia mwanaghe mdodo ng'asolighwe baye. <verse eid="2CH 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Kuya Imulungu kamghalila mfalume utamu wa munda ing'auhoneka baye. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Kaghendelela kughula, na utamu wake wongetseka chila hakukucha, na ghumwaka ghwa kabili haghung'ali ghomala usapi wake ulawa kunze kwa utamu wake awo iyali nawo, kuya kafa kwa usungu mkulu. Iwanu wake ng'awabwinile baye ghumoto wadomboketse ka pfawatendile kwa iwahenga wake. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehoramu tsakandusa kutawala aku kana miyaka salasini na mili na katawala aku kakala Yerusalemu kwa miaka minane. Hayafile kuduhu imunu wowose iyonile usungu. Kuya wamtsika mna ghumji ghwa Daudi, ila si hanu hawotsikighwa wafalume baye.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Ahazia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Iwanu wa Yerusalemu wamwika Ahazia, imwana mtsuwanda wa Yehoramu yawe mfalume yatawale hanu ha aba wake, kwaapfila iwabala wake wose tsawakomighwa na mitsinu ihile itsile na Warabu kuna indalo. Apfo Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu kawa mfalume wa Yuda, kanza kutawala <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahazia tsakana miyaka alubaini na mili hayawile mfalume, katawala Yuda kwa mwaka ghumwe aku kokala Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Atalia, mtsukulu wa Omri. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Naye pfipfila katenda ghaghala ghawatendile iwanu wa ing'anda ya Ahabu, kwaapfila mai wake yang'ali yomlongotsa mna ukutenda ghaghala ighehile. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka pfawatendile iwanu wa ing'anda ya Ahabu, kwaapfila aba wake hayafile, wawo wang'ali womfunda mna ukutenda ghehile. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Pfipfila kawinza ghawamlongele, kaghenda na Yoramu, mwana wa Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli kwitowa na Hazaeli mfalume wa Shamu ako Ramoti Gileadi. Ako Waashamu wamlagha Yoramu. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Apfo mfalume Yoramu koya mna isi ya Yezireeli yahone ipfilonda pfake pfawamlaghile iwanu wa Aramu ako Ramoti hawang'ali wetowa na mfalume wa Aramu. Naye Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu mfalume wa Yuda kahulumka kaghenda Yezireeli kumwona Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu yana ipfilonda. <verse eid="2CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Imulungu tsakabama ghendo Ahazia yakomighwe ahala hayamwangile Yoramu. Kwaapfila hayapfikile ako, tsakalawa na Yoramu, waghenda kwitingana na Yehu, mwana wa Nimshi iyasaghulighwe na Imulungu yawakome iwanu wa ing'anda ya Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Yehu hayang'ali yowahigha iwana wa Ahabu ketingana na wakulu wa Yuda hamwe na iwana wamale wa ndughu tsake Ahazia iwelongotse na Ahazia, Yehu kawakoma. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Kuya iwanu wake Yehu wambama Ahazia, na wamghogha hayang'ali kepfisa ako Samaria. Nawo wamghala kwa Yehu, kuko Yehu kamkoma. Walutsika lukuli lwake mana tsawalonga, “Yeye mtsukulu wa Yehoshafati, iyambamile Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:9">Apfo kuduhu hata munu yumwe wa ing'anda ya Ahazia iyadahile kuwa mfalume.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malikia Atalia kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2 Wafal 11:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Naye Atalia, mai wake mfalume Ahazia, hayonile imwanaghe kafa, kalaghitsa iwanu wose wa ikaye ya ing'anda ya chifalume ya Yuda wakomighwe. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Lekeni Yehosheba, imwana pinga wa mfalume Yehoramu kamsola chinyelenyele Yoashi, mwana wa Ahazia, kulawa kuna iwana wa mfalume iwabamighwe kukomighwa. Kampfisa na yaya wake mna ichiheleto cha ukwikila ipfilagho ipfili mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Apfo Yehosheba neghe mfalume Yehoramu, iyali mwehe wa mtambika Yehoyada, na tsa lumbu wake Ahazia, kampfisa imwana ayo yaleke kukomighwa na Atalia. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Naye Yoashi kakala na Yehosheba kwa miyaka sita, aku kapfisighwa mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, ahala Atalia hayang'ali yotawala isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Atalia kobokighwa ufalume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:4-16">2 Wafal 11:4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa saba mtambika Yehoyada kalangusa ingupfu yake. Kelaghana na pfilongotsi awano iwalongotse maasikali miya miya: Azariya mwana wa Yehoramu, Ishmaeli mwana wa Yehohanani, Azariya mwana wa Obedi, Maaseya mwana wa Adaya, na Elishafati mwana wa Zikiri. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Wanga mna isi yose ya Yuda na wawakema hamwe Walawi na pfilongotsi wa tsikaya tsa Isiraeli waghende Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />Kuko iwanu wose iwetingane weka laghano na mfalume mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Yehoyada kawalongela, “Lola, imwana yuno wa mfalume yuyo iyatsakuwa mfalume ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile kwa iwatsukulu wa Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Namwe mtsotenda apfino: selusi yenu imwe mwemwe watambika na Walawi imsang'ana mna litsuwa lya ukubwihila, mtsokalitsa ghamalango gha ing'anda ya Imulungu, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />selusi iyaghe itsokalitsa ing'anda ya mfalume na selusi ingi itsololesa Lilango ilikemighwa Lilango lya Msingi. Na wanu wamwenga wose wakale hana ichibwalu cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Mleke kumleka munu yungi wowose yengile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, wengile watambika na Walawi waliyeka iwatsosang'ana. Awo wodaha kwingila kwaapfila wawo wetenda wela, lekeni iwanu wangi wose watsotenda chayalaghitse IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Walawi watsomtsunguluka mfalume, chila munu yakinde isilaha mmoko mwake. Imunu wowose iyatsoghetsa kwingila mna ing'anda ya Imulungu katsokomighwa. Mkale habehi na mfalume kokose kwayoghenda.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Walawi na iwanu wose wa Yuda watenda ka pfayalaghitse mtambika Yehoyada. Chila chilongotsi wa maasikali kawemilila iwanu wake, awala iwang'ali womalitsa ing'onde yawo, na awala iwang'ali wakwanza ing'onde yawo mna litsuwa lya ukubwihila, kwaapfila Yehoyada ng'amlekile baye munu wowose yoke. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Kuya mtambika Yehoyada kaweng'a pfilongotsi wa maasikali miya miya imigoha, na tsingao tsing'ulu na tsindodo tsa mfalume Daudi itsikalile mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Kuya kawemitsa iwanu wose iwokalitsa wamtsunguluke mfalume aku chila munu kakinda isilaha mmoko mwake wamtsunguluka mfalume habehi na hanu ha ukutambikila na habehi ha ing'anda ya Imulungu, kulawa ubali wa kusini mbaka ubali wa kaskazini wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Kuya Yehoyada na iwanaghe wamale wamlapfa kunze imwana wa mfalume, wampfatsa litaji, wambaka ghamapfuta yawe mfalume, na wamwing'a ichitabu cha lilaghano. Iwanu wadeng'elelela aku wokemelela, “Imulungu yakwike mfalume!” <verse eid="2CH 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Malikia Atalia hayahulike iwanu wotsuma na womdeng'elela mfalume, kawaghendela iwanu awo hana ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Hayasungulile kamwona mfalume kema habehi na ingutso yake ikalile hanu ha ukwingilila aku iwakulu na watowa malati wamtsunguluka. Iwanu wose wadeng'elela na watowa tsimalati na awala iwakwimba aku wotowa tsingoma tsawo wang'ali wowalongotsa iwanu mna ukudeng'elela ako. Baho Athalia kadegha ghamaghwanda ghake, kakemelela, kalonga, “Wanibiduka! Wanibiduka!” <verse eid="2CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Kuya mtambika Yehoyada kawalapfa kunze pfilongotsi iwolongotsa maasikali miya miya, na iwakulu wa maaskali, kawalongela, “Mlapfeni mna imisululu, na imunu wowose iyomuwinza mkomeni na limaghe.” Kwaapfila mtambika tsakalonga, “Mleke kumkomela mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Apfo wamghogha Atalia, na hawapfikile hana inzila ya Lilango lya Falasi lya ing'anda ya mfalume, wamkomela baho.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyada kowoyitsa iwanu kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:17-20">2 Wafal 11:17-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yehoyada keka laghano ka yeye mwenyegho, na mfalume na iwanu wose wawe wanu wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Kuya iwanu wose waghenda kuimwagha ing'anda ya kumtambikila Baali, kuko watulatula tsimatsabau na ipfinyagho pfili mumo, kuya wamkoma Matani, mtambika wa Baali hambele ha tsimatsabau atso. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Naye mtambika Yehoyada kaweka iwatambika iwolawa mna ilukolo lwa Walawi wakalitse ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ka apfila Daudi pfayalaghitse. Pfipfila kawalaghitsa walapfe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa ka pfayandikighwe mna Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, hamwe na ukudeng'elela na ukwimba. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Pfipfila keka wakalitsi hana lilango lya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ili munu wowose ing'ayelile yaleke kwingila. <verse eid="2CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Pfipfila kawasola pfilongotsi wa maasikali miya miya, iwanu iwomanyika wa Yuda, iwakulu wa isi na iwanu wose wali muisi, waghenda kumsola mfalume na wahulumka naye kulawa kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA mbaka kuna ing'anda ya mfalume. Wengila kuna ing'anda ya mfalume kwa kwang'ila lilango lya kuchanya, na wamwika mfalume yakale mna ichighoda cha mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Apfo iwanu wose iwali muisi wadeng'elela. Kuya ghumji ghose tsaghukala tulu kwaapfila Atalia kakomighwa.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoashi kakuwa Mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yoashi tsakana miyaka saba ahala hayanzile kutawala isi ya Yuda. Katawala kwa miyaka alubaini aku kokala Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Zibia kulawa ghumji ghwa Beerisheba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yoashi katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA mna ghamatsuwa ghose mtambika Yehoyada hayakalile mgima. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyada kamkwelela mfalume Yoashi wehe weli, nawo wamwelekela wana wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="2CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Hambele Yoashi kalamla kuitsenga keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Apfo kawakema watambika na Walawi, kawalongela, “Mghende kuna imiji ya Yuda, mkabokele tsisendi tsawolihagha Waisiraeli wose chila mwaka, tutsitsengele keli ing'anda ya Imulungu wenu, lelo msumke mghende.” Lekeni Walawi ng'awasumke baye. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Kuya mfalume kamkema Yehoyada chilongotsi wawo, kamghutsa, “Heule ng'ubamile baye Walawi wasole ikodi kulawa mna Yuda na Yerusalemu, ikodi iyalaghitse Musa munu wa IMNDEWA iwanu walihe, iwe yakulolela Lihema lienzeluke?” <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Kwaapfila iwanu iwamuwinzile Atalia, ipinga ayula yehile, tsawaibomola ng'anda ya Imulungu na wengila mghati, na ipfinu pfose ipfilapfighwe pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA tsawapfisola na kuitambikila milungu ya Baali. <verse eid="2CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Apfo mfalume kawalaghitsa Walawi, wasongole sanduku lya kwikila tsisendi walike kunze hana lilango lya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Kuya wawatangatsila iwanu wose iwali mna imiji yose ya Yuda na Yerusalemu wamghalile IMNDEWA ikodi, ka apfila Musa imunu wa Imulungu pfayawalaghitse Waisiraeli hawang'ali wa kunyika. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Iwakulu wose na iwanu wose wadeng'elela, waghala ikodi yawo na wayika mna lisanduku alyo mbaka limema. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Chila Walawi hawalighalile lisanduku alyo kwa iwakulu iwomsang'anila mfalume, nawo hawakona ka kuna sendi nyingi, imwandishi wa mfalume na imunu iyomwapfila mtambika mkulu wotsilapfa tsisendi tsili msanduku, kuya wolyuitsa keli hanu hake. Waghendelela kutenda apfo chila mala, apfo wapata sendi nyingi. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Mfalume na Yehoyada waweng'a tsisendi atso iwanu awala iwemilile isang'ano ya ukuitsenga inganda ya IMNDEWA. Nawo wawakema iwatsenga ng'anda, iwasongola mibiki, mafundi chuma na mafundi shaba watse waitsenge keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Apfo mafundi awo wasang'ana kwa ghumoyo ghwawo ghwose ing'onde ayo, waitsenga ghoya keli ing'anda ya Imulungu ka pfaikalile ghumwande, nayo ima ghoya. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Hawamalitse kutsenga ing'anda, wamghalila mfalume na Yehoyada tsisendi itsikalile, kuya ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu pfitendighwa kwa fetsa atso. Pfinu apfo pfitumika mna isang'ano ya ing'anda ya Imulungu, na mna ukulapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na pfinu pfa ukudusulila ubani na pfinu pfimwenga pfa nzahabu na fetsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 24:14">Matsuwa ghose gha Yehoyada hayakalile mgima, iwanu waghendelela kulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu woleka kughawinza gha Yehoyada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Lekeni Yehoyada kalala, na hayapfikile miyaka miya na salasini kafa. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Wamtsika kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kwawatsikighwe iwafalume, kwaapfila tsakatenda ighanoghile mna isi ya Isiraeli, kwa Imulungu, na kwa ing'anda yake. <verse eid="2CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Yehoyada hayafile, iwakulu wa Yuda wamtsila na wamwinamila Yoashi, walonga naye, naye kawatogholela chawabamile. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Apfo iwanu waleka kutambika mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo, wanza kutambikila tsingutso tsa Maashera na pfinyagho. Imulungu kawonela maya iwanu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu kwa ukutotsa ako. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Hata apfo IMNDEWA kawaghalila manabii wawakanye, na woye kuna yeye, lekeni wawo ng'awahulike baye. <verse eid="2CH 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Baho Muhe wa Imulungu kamtsila Zakaria mwana wa mtambika Yehoyada, naye kema hambele hanu henuke chidogho, kawalongela, “Imulungu komghutsani, hebali mleka kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake? Ng'amdaha baye ukubweda! Kwaapfila mumleka IMNDEWA, naye kamlekani.” <verse eid="2CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Iwanu wabama kumkoma Zakaria, na mfalume kawalaghitsa iwanu wamtowe na ghamabwe hana uluwa lwa ing'anda ya Imulungu mbaka yafe. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Mfalume Yoashi kamkoma Zakaria, naye kaghasemwa ghose ghayamtendele Yehoyada aba wake Zakaria. Zakaria hayafile kalonga, “IMNDEWA yone alyino na yamuyitsile iyatendile apfino.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa ufalume Yoashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Ghumwaka haghung'ali ghumala, maasikali wa Shamu waipfamila Yuda na Yerusalemu. Wawakoma iwakulu wose, wasola pfinu pfingi wapfighala kwa mfalume wa Damaski. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Hata ka maasikali wa Shamu tsa wachidogho, Imulungu kawapfila wawatowe maasikali wa Yuda iwakalile wengi, kwaapfila iwanu wa Yuda tsawamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo. Apfo Imulungu kamuhigha Yoashi kubitila Washamu. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Waashamu hawokile wamleka Yoashi kalaghighwa ghendo. Iwatumighwa wake watenda tsengwe lya kumkoma, kwaapfila yeye tsakamkoma imwana wa mtambika Yehoyada. Apfo wamkoma hayang'ali kawasa mlusatsi mwake. Kuya katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, lekeni si ahala hawotsikighwa iwafalume baye. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Iwanu iwamtendele tsengwe lya kumkoma wawo awano, Zebadi mwana wa pinga iyakemighwe Shimeati wa ilukolo lwa Amoni, na Yehozabadi mwana wa pinga wa Moabu iyakemighwe Shimriti. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Aghala ghose ghawatendile iwana wamale wa Yoashi, gha ukutsenga keli ghoya ing'anda ya Imulungu, na unabii wose ulongighwe kuna yeye, wandikighwa mna ichitabu cha wafalume. Na Amazia imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Amazia kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amazia tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, na katawala kwa miyaka ishilini na tisa aku kokala Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yehoadani, iyolawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Yeye katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA lekeni ng'aghatendile baye kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ufalume wa Amazia hawimile ghoya, kawakoma iwatumighwa iwamkomile mfalume Yoashi, aba wake. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Lekeni ng'awawakomile baye iwana wa awala iwamkomile aba wake, ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha malaghitso cha Musa ahala IMNDEWA hayalaghitse, kalonga, “Aba au mai ng'atsokomighwa baye kwa inzambi iyatendile imwanaghe, na imwana ng'atsokomighwa baye kwa inzambi iyatendile aba wake au mai wake, chila munu katsakufa kwa inzambi iyatendile imwenyegho.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ondo na Waedomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Mfalume Amazia tsakawakema hamwe iwamale wa Yuda na Benjamini. Kuko kaweka wakele mna makingili gha wamale elufu imwe imwe, na wamwenga walongotse wanu miya imwe imwe, kwa ukulola tsikolo tsa aba tsawo. Kuya Kawapeta iwanu wana imiyaka ishilini na kughendelela, baho kapata wanu elufu ndatu iwakalile ghoya kwa kughenda kung'ondo na iwadahile kwitowa kwa migoha na tsingawo. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Kuya kawakodi wamale laki imwe kulawa Isiraeli iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya na kawaliha kilo ka elufu ndatu tsa fetsa. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Lekeni imunu wa Imulungu kamghendela, kamlongela, “Ghwe mfalume, uleke kwilongotsa na maasikali wa Isiraeli kung'ondo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA ng'ali hamwe na iwanu wa Isiraeli baye, ng'ali hamwe na awala iwana wa Efuraimu baye. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Hata ka koghenda kwitowa kwa tsingupfu tsako tsose, Imulungu katsokutenda utsume hambele ha maadui tsako, kwaapfila Imulungu kenatso tsingupfu tsa ukwapfila na tsa ukughwisa hasi.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amazia kamghutsa imunu ayo wa Imulungu, “Lelo pfihi fetsa tsila tsatuwalihile maasikali kulawa Isiraeli?” Imunu wa Imulungu kamwidika, “Imulungu kodaha kukwing'a fetsa nyingi kubita atso.”<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Baho Amazia kawalekelela maasikali iyawakodile kulawa Efuraimu woye mmakaye mwawo. Nawo woya mmakaye mwawo aku wawaghudubukila ghendo iwanu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amazia keghuma ingupfu imwenyegho, kawalongotsa maasikali wake, kaghenda kuna Lwanda lwa Ghumkele. Kuko kawakoma maasikali elufu kumi kulawa Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Kuya wawaghogha maasikali elufu kumi, wawadinitsa mchidando mwa libambalawe kulu, kuya wawatupa hasi kulawa kuna libambalawe alyo, nawo wafa aku wabenekabeneka. <verse eid="2CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Kuya maasikali awala wa Isiraeli iyawalekile Amazia woye mmakaye mwawo, iyawaghomile waleke kughenda naye kung'ondo, waghenda kuipfamila imiji ya Yuda kulawa Samaria mbaka Beti Horoni, kuya wawakoma iwanu elufu ndatu na waboka pfinu pfingi. <verse eid="2CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amazia hayoile kulawa kuwatowa Waedomu koya na milungu ya wanu wa Edomu, kaimitsa wima iwe milungu yake, kaitambikila na kuidusulila upfumba. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Chinu acho chimtenda IMNDEWA yone maya, apfo kamtuma nabii yaghende kwa Amazia. Nabii ayo kamghutsa Amazia, “Heule ghweghwe koitambikila milungu ya wanu wangi, milungu aila ing'aidahile kuwakombola iwanu wake wenyegho kulawa mna ghamoko ghako?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Lekeni hata ng'ana yamalitse baye ukulonga, Amazia kamlongela, “Nyamale! Angu tukusaghule tsuwachi uwe munu yumlangulitsa mfalume? Angu ghweghwe kobama ukukomighwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Nabii ayo kamlongela apfino, “Nomanya ghendo Imulungu kobama yakukome, kwaapfila kutenda ghose aghano, kuya koghabetsa aghano ghanikulongela.” Kuya kaleka ukulonga naye.<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ondo na Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Apfo mfalume Amazia wa Yuda tsakalonga na iwashauli wake, kuya katuma nume ighende kwa Yehoashi, mwana wa Yehoahazi, mwana wa Yehu mfalume wa Isiraeli, kamlongela, “Utse twitowe.” <verse eid="2CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Lekeni Yehoashi mfalume wa Israeli kamwidika Amazia mfalme wa Yuda, kalonga, “Luchongoma luli Lebanoni tsalutuma nume kuna ghumbiki ghwa mwerezi ighuli kuko Lebanoni, ghulonga, ‘Umleke mwanagho pinga yakwelighwe na imwanangu.’ Kuya kabita mnyama wa kubagho kalubajugha iluchongoma alula. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Ghweghwe kwelongela ghumwenyegho ka kuwatowa ghendo Waedomu, na sambi kotamba na kweghoda, lekeni nokulongela ukale ukaye yako, heule wibamila ghamaghayo ighatsokukoma ghweghwe ghumwenyegho hamwe na iwanu wako wa Yuda?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Lekeni Amazia ng'ategheletse baye alyo kwaapfila Imulungu mwenyegho tsakabama Amazia yatowighwe, kwaapfila Amazia tsakaitambikila imilungu ya Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Apfo Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli kagheluka, kaghenda kwitowa na mfalume Amazia wa Yuda. Wetingana uhanga kwa uhanga ako Beti Shemesi mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Waisiraeli wawatowa iwanu wa Yuda, na chila munu katsumila ukaye yake. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli kamghogha Amazia mfalume wa Yuda, imwana wa Yoashi, na mtsukulu wa Ahazia ako Beti Shemesi. Kuya kamghala Yerusalemu na kuko kaumwagha ubanda wa Yerusalemu kwanzila lilango lya Efuraimu mbaka lilango likalile hana imembe, utali wake tsa futi miya sita. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Kasola inzahabu yose na ifetsa yose na ipfinu pfose ipfoneke mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, ipfing'ali pfilolesighwa na Obedi Edomu na pfinu pfose ipfikalile mna ing'anda ya chifalume. Kuya kasola iwanu iyawaghoghile, na koya Samaria. <verse eid="2CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amazia imwana wa Yoashi, mfalume wa Yuda kakala miyaka kumi na mitano tangiya hayafile Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Ghose ghayatendile Amazia tangiya hayanzile ufalume mbaka hayamalitse tsaghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda na Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Kulawa matsuwa aghala Amazia hayamlekile IMNDEWA, iwanu watenda tsengwe ako Yerusalemu lya ukumkoma Amazia, apfo katsumila Lakishi, lekeni iwanu awo watuma wanu wamuwinzilitsa ako Lakishi na wamkomela kuko. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Ilukuli lwake waluyitsa kwa kuludinitsa mna ifalasi, na wamtsika Yerusalemu kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kwawatsikighwe sekulu tsake.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Uzia Kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Kuya iwanu wose wa Yuda wamsola Uzia, imwanaghe Amazia, iyakalile na miyaka kumi na sita wamtawatsa yawe mfalume wawo, yasole hanu ha Amazia, aba wake. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Hayafile Amazia, Uzia yuyo iyaghutsengile keli ghumji ghwa Elati na kughuyitsa kuna utawala wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uzia tsakana miyaka kumi na sita hayawile mfalume, na katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka hamsini na mili. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yekolia, iyolawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Uzia katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka apfila Amazia aba wake pfayatendile. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Tsakelapfa imwenyegho mna ukumbama Imulungu mna ghamatsuwa gha Zekaria hayawile kamgima, Zekaria tsakamfunda Uzia yampfuke Imulungu. Chila pfayambamile IMNDEWA, naye Imulungu kamtenda yabwede. <verse eid="2CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Uzia kaghenda kwitowa na Wafilisti, kaibomola imibanda ya ghumji ghwa Gati, Yabine na Ashidodi. Kaitsenga keli imiji iikalile habehi na Ashidodi na kungi mna isi ya Filisti. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Imulungu kamwapfila ukuwahuma Wafilisti, Waarabu iwakalile Guri Baali, na Wameuni. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Waamoni tsawamliha ikodi, naye tsakamanyika mbaka Misiri, kwaapfila ufalume wake tsauna ngupfu. <verse eid="2CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Kuya Uzia katsenga minala ako Yerusalemu hana imembe ya Lilango na hana Lilango lya Kulwanda, na hana imembe ya ubanda, na kaitsengela mibanda iminala ayo. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Pfipfila katsenga minala kunyika, kuya kahimba matsimbu mengi, kwaapfila tsakana wanyama wengi iwakalile hasi ha ipfidunda na mna ipfiwala. Kwaapfila ukulima tsakumnoghela, tsakana wanu iwang'ali wosang'ana mna imighunda yake ingi na mna imighunda yake ya mitsabibu ikalile kupfidunda na ina lidongo linoghile. <verse eid="2CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Kubita agho ghose Uzia tsakana maasikali iwakalile ghoya kwa ukwitowa. Tsaweghola mna ghamakingili hawabamile kughenda kwitowa, mwandishi Yeieli na mkulu wawo Maaseya kaghandika ghamataghwa ghawo, aku wang'ali wolongotsighwa na Hanania, chilongotsi yumwe wa mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Maasikali awo wose wang'ali wolongotsighwa na pfilongotsi elfu mbili na mia sita. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Nawo wang'ali wowalongotsa maasikali laki ndatu na elufu saba na miya tano, wana tsingupfu ya ukumwapfila mfalume yawatowe maadui tsake. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uzia kaweng'a maasikali awo tsingawo, imigoha, kofia tsa chuma, maghwanda gha chuma, minde na ghamabwe gha ukwika mna tsing'umbewe. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Ako Yerusalemu iwanu wake wamtengenetsela mitambo ya ukwasila imishale na ghamabwe makulukulu. Uzia kayika mna iminala na hana tsimembe tsa ubanda wa ghumji. Tsakamanyika chila hanu, na ngupfu tsake tsongetseka sideke kwaapfila Imulungu yang'ali yomwapfila ghendo.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzia kotowighwa kwa Ichidandali chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Lekeni mfalume Uzia hayawile na tsingupfu ng'ani, tsakeghoda, na maghodo ghake ghamghwisa hasi. Tsakamtendela totso IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, kwa ukwingila mna ing'anda ya Imulungu aku kobama yadusule upfumba hana imatsabahu ya ukudusulila upfumba. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Lekeni mtambika Azaria aku kelongotsa na watambika semanini ing'awopfuka wamuwinzilitsa mfalume mghati, <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />kuko wamghoma, wamlongela, “Uzia, aino si sang'ano yako baye ukumdusulila IMNDEWA upfumba. Aino sang'ano ya iwatambika, ilukolo lwa Aruni, iwasaghulighwe kudusula upfumba. Lawa hanu ahano haenzeluke, mana kumtendela totso Imulungu, kuya ng'utsotogholighwa keli baye na IMNDEWA Imulungu.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Uzia tsakema habehi na imatsabahu aku kakinda chetetso cha ukudusulila upfumba mmoko mwake. Kawonela maya iwatambika, na baho hayawonele maya, ukoma umlawila mchihanga mwake hambele ha iwatambika awo, mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA habehi na imatsabahu ya ukudusulila upfumba. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Mtambika mkulu Azaria na awala iwatambika wangi, hawamlolile, wona kana ukoma mna uhanga wake, apfo wasumka ukumlapfa kunze. Hata yeye imwenyegho ghendo tsakasumka ukulawa kunze, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamtowa. <verse eid="2CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Apfo mfalume Uzia kakala na ukoma wake mbaka hayafile. Tsakakala yali yeka mna ing'anda yake, kaghomighwa yaleke ukwingila mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Naye Yotamu, imwanaghe kemilila ing'anda ya mfalume na kawatawala iwanu wali muisi. <verse eid="2CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Ghose ghayatendile mfalume Uzia tangiya hayanzile ufalume mbaka hayamalitse, kaghandika nabii Isaya, mwana wa Amozi. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Kuya Uzia kafa, katsikighwa habehi na hanu hawotsikighwa wafalume, kwaapfila tsawalonga, “Yeye kana ukoma.” Naye Yotamu, imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yotamu Kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yotamu tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, katawala aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na sita. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yerusha, neghe Sadoki. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka apfila Uzia, aba wake pfayatendile, ila yeye ng'engile baye kudusula upfumba mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Hata apfo iwanu tsawaghendelela ukutenda ghehile. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotamu kalitsenga keli Lilango lya Kuchanya lya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Kuya katenda ng'onde ng'ulu ya ukutsenga keli ubanda uli kuchidunda cha Ofeli. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Kuya katsenga miji mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Yuda, pfipfila katsenga mibanda na minala ako kumihulo. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yotamu ketowa na mfalume wa Amoni, na kamhuma. Ghumwaka agho Waamoni wamliha tani ndatu na nusu tsa fetsa, tani elufu imwe tsa ngano, na tani elufu imwe tsa shayiri. Waamoni waghendelela kutenda apfo mna ghumwaka ghwa kabili na ghwa kadatu. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Mfalume Yotamu kaghendelela kuwa na ngupfu, kwaapfila tsayang'ali yomtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="2CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yotamu, tsing'ondo tsayetowile, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Yotamu tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na sita. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Kuya kafa na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kwawatsikighwe wahenga wake. Ahazi imwanaghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Ahazi kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahazi tsakana miyaka ishilini hayawile mfalume, katawala kwa miyaka kumi na sita aku kokala Yerusalemu. Yeye ng'atendile baye ka sekulu wake Daudi lekeni katenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Kakala ka pfawakalile wafalume wa Isiraeli, kuya kafina pfinyagho pfa Mabaali. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Kadusula upfumba hana ulwanda lwa Hinomu na kuwalapfa iwanaghe wawe nambiko ya kulakatsighwa, katenda pfinu pfa ukudesa pfawatendile iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi, awala IMNDEWA iyawawingile hambele ha Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Kalapfa nambiko na kudusula upfumba kuna tsimatsabahu tsili hanu henulighwe, kupfidunda, na hasi ha chila mbiki ghutimile.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayuda wotowighwa na Waisiraeli na Wasiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Apfo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, kamleka yaghoghighwe na mfalume wa Siria. Washamu wamtowa na wawaghogha iwanu wake, woya nawo Dameski. Pfipfila mfalume wa Isiraeli naye katsa kamghogha na kawakoma iwanu wake wengi sideke. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Peka mwana wa Remalia, kwa tsuwa limwe kawakoma wanu wa Yuda laki imwe na elufu ishilini, kwaapfila Wayuda tsawamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Asikali yumwe wa Efuraimu iyakemighwe Zikiri kamkoma Maaseya, mwana wa mfalume, na Azirikamu, mkulu wa ing'anda ya mfalume, na Elikana, munu wakeli kwa ukulu kulawa mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Waisiraeli wawaghogha Wayuda laki mbili iwali ndughu tsawo ghendo, awo tsamapinga, na iwana wamale na mapinga. Pfipfila waboka mali tsawo nyingi na woya natso Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabii Obedi Kowakembela Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Lekeni tsakuna munu yumwe taghwa lyake Obedi, nabii wa IMNDEWA, iyang'ali yokala Samaria, kalawa kaghenda kuwabokela Waisiraeli iwang'ali wakuya kulawa Samaria, kawalongela, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu tsakawaghudubukila iwanu wa Yuda, kawaleka waghoghighwe na mwemwe, lekeni mwemwe muwakoma pfihile mbaka imaya yenu ipfika kulanga. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Namwe mwobama kuwatenda iwamale na iwapinga wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu wawe watumwa wenu. Lekeni mwemwe muwenyegho pfihi, ng'ammanyile baye ka mwomtendela nzambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Lelo mnitegheletse, muwoyitse ndughu tsenu na lumbu tsenu wamuwaghoghile, kwaapfila imaya ng'ulu ya IMNDEWA itsowatsila mchanya mwenu.” <verse eid="2CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Nawo pfilongotsi wangi wa Efuraimu, tsina Azaria, mwanaghe Yehohanani, Berekia mwanaghe Meshilemoti, Yehizikia mwanaghe Shalumu na Amasa mwanaghe Hadilai pfipfila wawalonga awala iwalawile kwitowa. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Wawalongela apfino, “Iwanu wamuwaghoghile mleke kuwaghala ahano. Ma tutotsa hambele ha IMNDEWA, lelo mwobama mtwongetsele tsinzambi na ghamatotso? Kwaapfila ghamatotso ghatuli nagho ma makulu, na maya ng'ulu itutsila twetwe Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="2CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Apfo maasikali awo wawaleka iwanu awo iwawaghoghile na ipfinu pfawabokile hambele ha wapfilongotsi na hambele ha ghumtingano ghwose ghwa iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Iwanu awala iwakemighwe kwa mataghwa ghawo wawasola iwanu awo iwaghoghighwe, wawapfatsa awala iwali chidako ghamagwanda aghala ghawabokile, kuya waweng'a mikwabatsa, ipfijo na ipfinu pfa ukunwa, na wawabaka ghamapfuta mna ipfilonda. Awala iwatsilike, wawadinitsa mchanya mwa ipfihongwe, wawaghala iwanu wose iwawaghoghile mbaka Yeriko, ghumji ghwa mitende kwa ndughu tsawo, kuya wawo woya Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazi komlomba mfalume wa Ashuru yamwapfile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:7-9">2 Wafal 16:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Matsuwa agho mfalume Ahazi katuma wanu wakamlombe mfalume wa Ashuru yamwapfile, <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />kwaapfila Waedomu tsawatsa keli, wawatowa wanu wa Yuda, wawaghogha na kuka nawo. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Kuya matsuwa ghagho Wafilisti watsa kuitowa imiji ya Shefala na Negebu ya Yuda. Waisola imiji ya Beti Shemeshi, Ayaloni, Gedeloti, Soko, Timna, Gimzo, hamwe na ipfijiji pfawo. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Ahazi mfalume wa Isiraeli kamtenda IMNDEWA yaihulumse hasi isi ya Yuda, kwaapfila yeye tsakongetsa ighehile mna isi ya Yuda, na tsakatotsa sideke hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Tigilati Pileseri mfalume wa Ashuru tsakatsa kumdununza, na si ukumwapfila baye. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ahazi kasola inzahabu kulawa mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, na mna ing'anda ya mfalume na kulawa mna tsing'anda tsa pfilongotsi, kamwing'a mfalume wa Ashuru, lekeni ukutenda apfo ng'akumwapfile chinu baye.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzambi tsa Ahazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukudununzika, mfalume Ahazi tsakaghendelela ng'ani kumtendela nzambi IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Kwaapfila tsakailapfila nambiko milungu ya Dameski imtowile, tsakalonga, “Kwaapfila milungu ya Shamu tsaiwapfila wafalume wa Shamu, na nene ning'ailapfila nambiko songaha itsonyapfila.” Lekeni aghano ghamtenda Ahazi na iwanu wa isi ngima ya Isiraeli wakomighwe. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Pfipfila tsakapfisola pfinu pfose ipfili mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, kapfitula tula. Kuya kaihinda imilango ing'anda ye Imulungu, kuya ketsengela tsimatsabahu mna chila membe ya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Mna chila mji ako Yuda katsenga matsabahu tsa hanu henulighwe hawe ha ukudusulila upfumba kwa milungu ingi. Chinu acho chimtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa wahenga wake yamwonele maya. <verse eid="2CH 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Ghose ghayatendile kulawa hayanzile ufalume mbaka hayamalitse ghandikighwa mna chitabu cha kumbukumbu cha Wafalume wa Yuda na Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Kuya mfalume Ahazi kafa, katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, lekeni ng'atsikighwe baye kuna ghamakabuli gha wafalume wa Isiraeli. Naye Hezekia, imwanaghe, kawa mfalume, kasola hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Hezekia kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Wafal 18:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hezekia tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, na kaitawala Yuda kwa miyaka ishilini na tisa aku kokala Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Abiya, neghe Zekaria. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka sekulu wake Daudi pfayatendile.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda yakwikighwa iwe ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa mwanduso, na ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso ghwa ufalume wake Hezekia kapfughula keli imilango ya ing'anda ya Imulungu, kuya kaitsenga keli. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Kawengitsa iwatambika na Walawi, kuya kawatinganitsa kuna ichibwalu ichili mashaliki, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />kawalongela, “Mnitegheletse mwemwe Walawi! Mwitende mwele kuya muitende ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwabala wenu yele. Mpfilapfe ipfinu pfose pfihile ipfili hanu haenzeluke. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Kwaapfila iwahenga wetu tsawamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu. Wamleka, na ipfihanga pfawo pfihundukila kutali, na waing'a chisogho ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Wahinda imilango ya ichikuta cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, watsima ipfitasa, ng'awadusule baye upfumba wala kumlapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Apfo IMNDEWA kayonela maya ghendo isi ya Yuda na Yerusalemu, na aghala ghayawatendele ghawakangawatsa na kuwatenda iwanu wose wapfuke, nawo wotwowela, ka apfila pfamkona muwenyegho kwa tsinenge tsenu. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Chinu achino chiwatenda aba tsetu wakomighwe, na iwana wetu na wehe wetu waghoghighwe kung'ondo. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Lelo ghumoyo ghwangu ghobama ghendo kwilaghana na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, yaleke kughendelela kutwonela maya. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Lelo wanangu mleke kulibetsa alino, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamsaghuleni mwime hambele hake na mumsang'anile, muwalongotse iwanu wake mna ukumtambikila na ukumdusulila upfumba.” <verse eid="2CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Walawi wano wanza kusang'ana, lukolo lwa Kohati kalawa Mahati mwana wa Amasai na Yoeli mwana wa Asariya, lukolo lwa Merari kalawa Kishi mwana wa Abdi na Azariya mwana wa Yehaleli, lukolo lwa Gerishoni kalawa Yoa mwana wa Sima, na Edeni mwana wa Yoa, <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />lukolo lwa Elisafani, kalawa Shimori na Yeueli, <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />lukolo lwa Hemani, kalawa Zekaria na Matania, lukolo lwa Yedutuni kalawa Shemaya na Uzieli. <verse eid="2CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Awano wawakema hamwe Walawi wayawo, wetenda wela, kuya wengila mghati ka apfila mfalume pfayawabamile watende, wandusa kuitenda ing'anda ya Imulungu yele ka IIMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Watambika wengila mghati mwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, walapfa kunze chila chinu ichihile. Kuya wapfika kuna ichibwalu cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Walawi wapfisola ipfinu apfo na wapfighala kuna ulwanda lwa Kidironi.<verse eid="2CH 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Wandusa kuchitenda ichikuta cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA chele kulawa mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa kwanza, na halipfikile litsuwa lya nane waimalitsa. Kuya wasang'ana matsuwa ghangi manane kuitenda ing'anda yose ya IMNDEWA yele, mbaka tsuwa lya kumi na sita lya ghumwetsi agho, chila chinu chimala.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda yolapfighwa keli iwe ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Kuya Walawi wengila mghati waghenda kwa mfalume Hezekia, wamlongela, “Tumalitsa kuitenda ing'anda ya IMNDEWA yele, hamwe na imatsabau ya ukulapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na ipfinu pfake pfose, na imetsa ya ukwikila ipfighate pfienzeluke nayo yela na ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Kuya pfinu pfose pfayapfasile mfalume Ahazi hayang'ali kamfalume, ahala hayamlekile Imulungu, tupfiyitsa na tupfilapfa pfiwe pfa Imulungu, na sambi pfa hambele ha imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="2CH 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Kuya ilupfi yake lupfilipfili, mfalume Hezekia kawatinganitsa hamwe wakulu wa ghumji, kuya kaghenda nawo kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Waghala ng'ombe wamale saba, ng'unzu saba, wana ng'olo saba, na mvulati saba, wawe nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi kwa iwanu wa ulukolo lwa chifalume, na kwa hanu haenzeluke na kwa iwanu wa Yuda. Kuya mfalume kawalaghitsa iwatambika, wa lukolo lwa Aruni wawalakatse mchanya mwa imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Apfo wachinja wang'ombe awo, na iwatambika waimitsa idamu yawo mchanya mwa imatsabahu, kuya wawachinja wang'unzu, na waimitsa idamu yawo mchanya mwa imatsabahu, kuya wawachinja iwana ng'olo awo, na waimitsa idamu yawo mchanya mwa imatsabahu. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Pfipfila waghala mvulati wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi habehi na mfalume na iwanu wose iwakalile baho, nawo weka ghamoko ghawo mchanya mwa wamvulati awo. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Kuya iwatambika wawachinja wamene awo mvulati, na waighida idamu yawo mchanya mwa imatsabahu, iwe nambiko ya kuwaleghusila tsinzambi Waisiraeli wose, welamlitse na Imulungu. Kwaapfila mfalume Hezekia tsakalaghitsa ilapfighwe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa na nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi kwa Waisiraeli wose. <verse eid="2CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Kaweka Walawi mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA aku wana makeyamba, wangi wana ipfinanda na wangi wana ipfinubi, ka pfayalaghitse Daudi na manabii Gadi na Natani, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakalaghitsa apfino kubitila manabii wake. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Walawi wema aku wakinda ipfinu pfa ukwimbila pfa Daudi, na iwatambika nawo wema aku wakinda malati tsawo. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Hezekia kalaghitsa inambiko ya ukulakatsighwa ilapfighwe mchanya mwa imatsabahu. Hawanzile ukulapfa tsinambiko, iwanu nawo wanza kumwimbila IMNDEWA, aku wanu wangi wanza kutowa tsimalati na ipfinu pfa ukwimbila pfa Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Ghumtingano ghwose ghwa iwanu wenama wamtambikila IMNDEWA, aku ukwimba na kutowa tsimalati kung'ali kughendelela mbaka ukulapfighwa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa hakumalile. <verse eid="2CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Ukulapfa nambiko hakumalile mfalume Hezekia na iwanu wose wenama wamtambikila Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Mfalume Hezekia na iwakulu wawalongela Walawi wamwimbile IMNDEWA kwa wila tsa Daudi na tsa nabii Asafu. Apfo iwanu wose wemba kwa ukudeng'elela na wenamitsa ghamatwi ghawo na waabudu. <verse eid="2CH 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Kuya Hezekia kawalongela iwanu, “Kwaapfila sambi mwemwe mwela hambele ha IMNDEWA, lelo msoghele mghale tsinambiko na nambiko tsa ukulonga mighede mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.” Apfo iwanu waghala nambiko tsawo na nambiko tsa ukumlongela mighede, na iwanu wose wana imimoyo ya uluso waghala tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Mtingano ghwose tsaghughala ng'ombe wamale sabini, ng'unzu miya imwe, na wana ng'olo miya mbili wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Awano wose tsawalapfighwa wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Pfipfila walapfa ng'ombe wamale miya sita, na wang'olo elufu ndatu, wawe nambiko ienzeluke. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Kwaapfila iwatambika tsawachidogho, ng'awadahile baye kuwahuna tsingotsi wanyama awo wose. Apfo ndughu tsawo Walawi wawapfila mbaka hawamalitse isang'ano ayo, na mbaka watambika wangi hawamalitse ukwitenda wela, kwaapfila Walawi tsawalangitsa ukwitenda wele ghendo kubita iwatambika. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Kubita tsinambiko atso nyingi itsilapfighwe tsilakatsighwe, pfipfila watambika walakatsa ghamapfuta gha wanyama iwalapfighwe wawe nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba, na waghida idipfai itsile hamwe na nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Apfo isang'ano ya ukutambika kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA yanza keli. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Mfalume Hezekia na iwanu wose wadeng'elela ghendo kwa aghala ghose Imulungu ghayawatendele iwanu, kwaapfila ing'ondea aino tsaitendeka himahima.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kodeng'elela Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Mfalume Hezekia tsakatuma wanu waghende Isiraeli yose na Yuda, kuya kawandikila baluwa wanu wa Manase na wa Efuremu, kawakema watse kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ako Yerusalemu kudeng'elela ichihungo cha Pasaka kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Mfalume na iwakulu na iwanu wose wa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu tsawalamla kudeng'elela chihungo cha Pasaka mna ghumwetsi wa kabili. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Ng'awadahile baye kudeng'elela mna ghumwetsi ghwake ka pfawang'ali wotendagha kwaapfila iwatambika iwetendile wela tsawachidogho na iwanu tsang'ana wetingane baye ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Apfo chinu achino tsachimnoghelesa mfalume na mtingano ghwose ghwa iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Apfo walamla kutowa lukemo mna isi yose ya Isiraeli, kulawa Beeri Sheba mbaka Dani, iwanu wobamighwa watse Yerusalemu kudeng'elela ichihungo cha Pasaka ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. Ipasaka ikalile na wanu wengi ka awo tsang'ana ideng'elelighwe baye, ka apfila pfayandikighwe. <verse eid="2CH 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Kwa kulaghitsighwa na mfalume na iwakulu, iwanu iwatumighwe waghenda mna Isiraeli na Yuda yose aku waghala baluwa iyandikighwe apfino;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 30:6">“Mwemwe wanu wa Isiraeli, imhonile kulawa mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Ashuru, muye kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Abrahamu na Isaka na Isiraeli, naye katsakuya kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Mleke kuwa ka iwahenga wenu na ndughu tsenu, awala iwawile si wakutogholeka baye kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo iyawahighile sideke ka pfamkona. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Lelo sambi mleke kuwa wasughu ka iwahenga wenu. Lekeni mwilapfe ghendo kwa IMNDEWA. Mtse kuna ing'anda yake iyaitendile ienzeluke matsuwa ghose, mumtumikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, nayo imaya yake ng'ulu itsakuka imlekeni. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Mng'amuyila IMNDEWA, iwanu awala iwawaghoghile ndughu tsenu na iwana wenu watsowonela libatsi na watsowalekelela woye mna isi aino. Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kamluso na kana libatsi. Apfo mng'amuyila, yeye katsowabokela.” <verse eid="2CH 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Apfo iwanu awo wanga kulawa mji ghumwe mbaka mji ghungi mna isi yose ya Efuraimu na Manase, kuya wapfika mbaka Zabuloni. Lekeni wanu wengi wawaseka na kuwabetsa. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Hata apfo wanu chidogho kulawa ghamakabila gha Asheri, Manase na Zabuloni watoghola kughenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Ngupfu ya Imulungu ing'ali isang'ana mna isi ya Yuda ya kuweng'a ghumoyo ghumwe ghwa kutenda aghala mfalume na iwakulu wake ghawawalaghiste, ka apfila pfayalaghitse Imulungu.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wodeng'elela Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Wanu wengi ng'ani wetingana ako Yerusalemu mna ghumwetsi ghwa kabili kudeng'elela chihungo cha ipfighate ipfilihela hamila. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Wabomola tsimatsabau ako Yerusalemu, tsimatsabahu tsa ukudusulila upfumba, kuya watsasa hana ulwanda lwa Kidironi. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Tsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi agho wachinja iwana wa ng'olo wa Pasaka. Watambika, na Walawi tsawona chinyala, kwa apfila tsang'awetendile wele baye, kuya wetenda wela na waghala nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Kuya watenda sang'ano tsawo mna ing'anda ya Imulungu ka pfawobamighwa na ghamalaghitso gha Musa munu wa Imulungu. Walawi tsawaweng'a iwatambika idamu ya nambiko, nawo iwatambika waimitsa mna imatsabahu. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Iwanu wengi iwetingane aho tsang'awelile baye, apfo Walawi wawachinjila wang'olo wa Pasaka iwanu awo, kuya wawalapfa wang'olo awo kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Iwanu wengi iwatsile kulawa Efraimu, Manase, Isakari na Zabuloni tsang'awelile baye, lekeni waja pfipfo ichihungo cha Pasaka, ing'apfibamighwa baye. Apfo Hezekia kawalombela, kalonga, “Imulungu yunoghile, mleghusile inzambi chila munu, <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />iyoghulapfa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose kukubama ghweghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wake, hata ka ng'elile baye ka pfaghobama ghamalaghitso gha hanu haenzeluke.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />IMNDEWA Imulungu katoghola chayalombile Hezekia, kawahonetsa iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Waisiraeli wose iwetingane Yerusalemu tsawadeng'elela ichihungo cha pfighate ipfilihela hamila kwa matsuwa saba, aku wodeng'elela sideke. Walawi na iwatambika wang'ali womwimbila Imulungu chila tsuwa kwa ngupfu tsawo tsose. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Mfalume Hezekia kawatoghola na kuwaghuma ghumoyo watambika kwaapfila tsawatenda kwa ukumanya ghoya sang'ano ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA. Waja kwa matsuwa saba mna ichihungo acho, walapfa nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba, na ukumtunya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wodeng'elela lwakeli Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Iwanu wose walamla kudeng'elela ichihungo acho kwa matsuwa saba ghangi, apfo waghendela kudeng'elela ichihungo acho kwa ghamatsuwa ghangi saba kwa ndeng'elo ng'ulu. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda kaweng'a ghumtingano ghwa iwanu ng'ombe wamale elufu imwe, na mene na wang'olo elufu saba. Pipfipfila iwakulu walapfa ng'ombe wamale elufu imwe na ng'olo elufu kumi. Iwatambika wengi tsawetenda wenyegho wele. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Ghumtingano ghose ghwa iwanu wa Yuda ghudeng'elela ghendo, tsawadengelela hamwe na Watambika na Walawi, iwenyekaye wa Yerusalemu hamwe na iwagheni iwalawile kunze, iwang'ali wokala Yerusalemu, na iwanu wose iwakalile Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Kukala na ndeng'elelo ng'ulu ako Yerusalem, kwaapfila kulawa hayatawale Selemani mwana wa Daudi, mfalume wa Isiraeli chinu ka acho tsang'ana chilawile baye. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Kuya iwatambika na Walawi wawalombela iwanu tsibalaka kwa Imulungu, naye Imulungu kahulika, kwaapfila ghawalombile ghampfikila ako kulanga, hanu hake haenzeluke hayokala yeye.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kowoyitsa iwanu kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Ichihungo hachimalile, iwanu wose wa Isiraeli tsawaghenda mna chila mji ighuli Yuda, kuko watsibena bena tsingutso tsa ghamabwe na kupfigana gana ipfinyagho pfa Ashera, mulungu pinga, kuya watsihinya tsimatsabau na hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi. Watenda pfipfo mna chila hanu ako Yuda, Benjamini, Efuraimu na ako Manase mbaka hawamalitse kuhinya chila chinu. Kuya woya mna imiji yawo, chila munu ukaye yake.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Mfalume Hezekia kawaghola keli iwatambika na Walawi mna makingili, kwa ukulola sang'ano tsawo. Kaweng'a iwatambika na Walawi ing'onde ya ukalapfa nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa, na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba na Imulungu, na kusang'ana hana ghamalango gha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ukumlongela Imulungu mighede na ukumwimbila. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Kulawa mna imifugho yake imwenyegho mfalume kalapfa wanyama wake wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa nemitondo na nemihe, na wawe nambiko tsa Litsuwa lya Kubwihila, na wawe nambiko mna ipfihungo pfa ukudeng'elela mlawo ghwa ghumwetsi, na wawe nambiko mna ipfihungo pfingi ipfandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Kubita agho, mfalume kawalaghitsa iwanu iwakalile Yerusalemu walapfe pfinu pfawobamighwa waweng'e iwatambika na Walawi, ili wawo welapfe ghendo mna ukughatenda aghala ghose ighali mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Iwanu wa Isiraeli hawahulike lilaghitso alyo, walapfa bwelele ipfijo pfikwanza ukwipfa, idipfai, ghamafuta, uki na pfinu pfose ipfilawile kuna imighunda, na walapfa tsaka bwelele ya chila chinu. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Iwanu wa Isiraeli na Yuda iwakalile mna imiji ya Yuda pfipfila waghala tsaka tsa wang'ombe na wang'olo na pfinu pfingi, pfipfila walapfa tsaka kwa Imulungu. Tsawapfika ipfinu apfo mna ghamabughulu. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Mna ghumwetsi ghwa kadatu wandusa kupfilundika ipfinu apfo mna malundo malundo, nawo wamalitsa mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Mfalume Hezekia na pfilongotsi wake hawatsile kughona ghamalundo agho, wamtunya Imulungu na wawabaliki iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Mfalume Hezekia kawaghutsa iwatambika na Walawi apfila ghamabughulu agho pfaghali makulu. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Azaria mtambika mkulu iyolawa mna ilukolo lwa Zadoki kamwidika, “Tangiya iwanu hawanzile kughala nambiko tsawo mna Ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, tupata pfijo pfingi pfa ukuja, na pfimwenga twakwika. Tupata pfinu pfose apfino kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawabaliki iwanu wake.” Apfo ghamabughulu aghano ghaukona pfipfo ipfinu ipfisighale. <verse eid="2CH 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Kuya mfalume Hezekia kawalaghitsa watsenge ing'anda ya ukwikila ipfinu ako kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu, nawo walitsenga, <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />amwo tsaweka nambiko, tsaka na pfinu pfose ipfikighwe wakifu. Kuya wamwika Konania Mlawi, yawe mkulu wa ukulolesa ipfinu apfo, na Shimei, ndughu yake kamwapfila. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Nawo tsina Yehieli, Azazia, Nahathi, Asaheli, Yeremothi, Yosabadi, Elieli, Ismakia, Mahathi na Benaya tsawekighwa wawapfile tsina Konania na Shimei ndughu yake. Awano wose tsawasaghulighwa na mfalume Hezekia na Azariya, mkulu wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kore mwana wa Imna, Mlawi iyang'ali yololesa Lilango lya mashariki lya ing'anda ya Imulungu, tsakemilila ipfijo pfose ipfilapfighwe kwa Imulungu, pfawalapfile iwanu kwa ukubama wenyegho, na yang'ali yopfighola ipfinu apfo pfa IMNDEWA, na pfinu pfingi ipfilapfighwe pfiwe pfa Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Nawo tsina Edeni, Miniamini, Yeshua, Shemaya, Amaria na Shekania, tsawamwapfila pfinoghile ghendo ng'onde ayo ya ukuwagholela iwatambika iwakalile mna imiji ingi. Wawagholela ndughu tsawo Walawi ipfijo, wabala kwa wadodo, <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />bila kulola kolo tsawo kwawandikighwe. Kuya wawagholela iwamale wana imiyaka midatu na kughendelela wana ghamataghwa ighandikighwe mna ipfitabu pfa ukukumbuka, awala iwadahile kwingila mna ing'anda ya Imulungu kusang'ana ng'onde tsawo tsa chila tsuwa, chila mtambika na Mlawi tsakabokela ipfinu apfino kwa ukulola ing'onde iyasang'ane. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Wawagholela iwatambika iwandikighwe mna ipfitabu pfa kumbukumbu kwa kulola ilukolo lwao, na wawagholela Walawi iwana miyaka ishilini na kughendelela kwa ukulola sang'ano tsawo na apfila pfawawagholeke. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Wawagholela mbaka iwana wawo wadowado, wehe tsawo, wana wawo wamale na neghe tsawo, na mtingano wose, kwaapfila wawo iwenyegho tsawetenda wela. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Pfipfila mna iwana wa Aruni, watambika iwakalile mna imighunda itsunguluke imiji yawo, tsahana wanu iwasaghulighwe ukughola ipfijo kwa chila mmale mna tsikaye tsa iwatambika, na chila munu iyandikighwe mghati mwa Walawi. <verse eid="2CH 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Apfo pfipfo mfalume Hezekia pfayatendile mna isi yose ya Yuda ighanoghile, ighagholoke na ghakutogholeka hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Mna chila chinu chayatendile mna ing'anda ya Imulungu na mna ukukinda ghamalaghitso na imiko, yeye tsakambama Imulungu wake na kamsang'anila kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose, Apfo tsakebweda mna chila chinu.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s">Waashuru wobama kuitenda Yerusalemu ipfuke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-19:14">2 Wafal 18:13-37–19:14-19,35-37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-37:8">Isa 36:1-22–37:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Haghamalile aghala ghose ghayatendile mfalume Hezekia kwa ukutogholeka, mfalume Senekaribu wa Ashuru kaipfamila isi ya Yuda. Katsa kuna imiji itsungulutsighwe ubanda aku kepfikitsa ka katsoiboka iwe yake. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Mfalume Hezekia hayonile ka mfalume Senakaribu katsa kobama kuitowa Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />kalamla yeye na wakulu wake, na pfilongotsi wa maasikali wadiwe ghamatsi gha tsimbwibwi itsilkalile kunze mwa ghumiji, nawo wamtogholela, wamwapfila. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Tsawetingana hamwe wanu wengi, wadiwa tsimbwibwi tsose hamwe na ghumto ighubitile hanu aho, walonga, “Heule tuwalekelele mfalume wa Ashuru watse na wone ghamatsi tele?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Ili kughwamila ghumji mfalume Hezekia tsakeghuma ghumoyo, kautsenga keli ubanda wose iumwaghike, na mchanya mwake keka minara. Katsenga ubanda ungi wa kunze, kuya kenulila ghamatuta hanu hakemighwe Milo mna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Kubita agho tsakatenda pfiheleto na ngao ketseketse. <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Mna ghumji iwanu wose tsawalongotsighwa na pfilongotsi wa maasikali, kuya kalaghitsa iwanu wetingane hamwe hana ichibwalu ichili hana Lilango lya ghumji. Baho tsakawaghuma ghumoyo iwanu, kawalongela, kalonga, <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Mgangamale na mwitowe chilume, mleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka hambele ha mfalume wa Ashuru, na maasikali wake iwali wengi kwaapfila yatuli naye twetwe mkulu kubita iyali naye Senakeribu. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Yeye kenatso tsingupfu tsa chimunu, ila twetwe tuna IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, iyotwapfila na iyotutowela ing'ondo yetu.” Acho chayalongile mfalume Hezekia chiwaguma ghumoyo ghendo iwanu awo. <verse eid="2CH 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Hambele chidogho Senakaribu mfalume wa Ashuru na maasikali wake wose, tsawang'ali woghupfingila ghumji ghwa Lakishi, kawatuma wasenga wake waghende Yerusalemu kwa Hezekia, mfalume wa Yuda na kwa iwanu wose wa Yuda iwakalile Yerusalemu, kalonga, <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga Senekaribu, mfalume wa Ashuru, Angu mwihuwila choni ghendo mbaka mng'ali mwokala Yerusalemu, ghumji ghupfingilighwe? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Hezekia hayolonga, ‘IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu katsotukombola kulawa mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Ashuru.’ Lekeni yeye kowaghutsukila. Yeye kowabamani mfe kwa nzala na mfe kwa ng'ilu hayowalongela apfo. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Angu si yeye baye Hezekia iyahahinyile hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila na matsabahu tsake, na kuwalaghitsa iwanu wose wa Yuda na Yerusalemu ahala hayalongile; ‘Mtsotambika kuna imatsabahu imwe na mtsolakatsa nambiko tsenu mchanya mwake.’ <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Angu mwemwe ng'ammanyile baye aghala ghose nene na iwahenga wangu apfila pfatuwatendile iwanu wa isi tsingi? Apfi milungu ya isi atso tsingi tsaidaha kutsikombola isi tsawo kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Angu mlungu yuhi mna milungu ya isi atso itsihinyighwe na wahenga wangu iyadahile kuwakobola wanu wake kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu? Pfihi lelo namwe mwololela ka Imulungu wenu katsomkombolani kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Mleke kumleka Hezekia yawabughe na yawaghutsukile apfo. Mleke kumtoghola munu ayo, kwaapfila kuduhu mlungu wa isi yoyose au mfalume wowose iyadahile kuwakombola wanu wake kulawa mna ghumoko ghwangu, wala kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa iwahenga wangu. Lelo ayo Imulungu wenu katsodaha?” <verse eid="2CH 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Iwasenga iwatumighwe na mfalume wa Ashuru tsawamlonga pfihile ghendo IMNDEWA, na Hezekia, mtumighwa wake. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Mfalume mweyegho kandika baluwa kumligha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kamlonga apfino, “Ka apfila milungu ya isi tsingi pfang'aidahile baye kuwakombola iwanu wawo kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu, pfipfila Imulungu wa Hezekia ng'atsodaha baye kuwakombola iwanu wake kulawa kuna nene.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Iwanu awo iwatumighwe na Senakaribu wakemelela kuwalongela kwa chilugha cha Chiheburania iwanu wa Yerusalemu iwakalile mlubanda, tsawabama wawaghele wogha na waghusole ghumji chibohola. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Tsawamlonga Imulungu wa Yerusalemu ka wolonga na milungu ya isi tsingi, itendighwe kwa ghamoko gha iwanu. <verse eid="2CH 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Baho mfalume Hezekia na nabii Isaya, mwana wa Amosi, wamlilila na wamlomba Imulungu iyali kulanga yawapfile mna imbuli aino. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Naye IMNDEWA kamtuma malaika wake, kaghenda kuwakoma maasikali, pfilongotsi wa maasikali iwakalile kuna indalo ya mfalume wa Ashuru. Apfo mfalume wa Ashuru koya ukaye yake aku kona chinyala. Baho hayengile mna ing'anda ya mlungu wake, iwanaghe imwenyegho wamkoma baho kwa limaghe. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />IMNDEWA kamkombola apfo mfalume Hezekia na iwanu wa Yerusalemu kulawa kuna ghumwoko ghwa Senakeribu mfalume wa Ashuru, na kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa maadui wake wose. Imulungu kaweka wakale tseghamba na iwanu wa isi itsili habehi nawo. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Iwanu wengi watsa Yerusalemu kumlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA na kumghweka ipfinu Hezekia, mfalume wa Yuda. Tangiya baho na kughundelela Hezekia katogholighwa ghendo na iwanu wose wa isi tsingi.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwighoda na ukughula kwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-3">2 Wafal 20:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:19">2 Wafal 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-3">Isa 38:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isa 39:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Ghamatsuwa agho Hezekia kaghula ng'ani chidogho yafe. Kamlomba IMNDEWA, naye Imulungu kamwidika na kamwing'a chitango ka katsohona. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Lekeni Hezekia tsakeghoda, kaleka kumlongela Imulungu mighede kwa aghala ghayamtendele, apfo IMNDEWA kamwonela maya yeye na iwanu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Lekeni hambele Hezekia kamuyila Imulungu, kaleka ghamaghodo ghake, na iwanu wa Yerusalemu watenda pfipfo, baho IMNDEWA kaleka kowonela maya mna ghamatsuwa agho gha mfalume Hezekia hayawile kamgima.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsimali na ukulu wa mfalume wa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Mfalume Hezekia tsakana mali nyingi na tsakatogholighwa sideke na iwanu, na ketsengela tsikano tsakwikila ifetsa, nzahabu, mabwe gha bei ng'ulu, pfilungo, tsingawo na pfinu pfose pfa bei ng'ulu. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Pfipfla tsaketsengela makano makulu gha ukwikila tsimbeghu, dipfai na ghamafuta gha mitseituni, na katsenga pfikwama pfa ukufughila wang'ombe na wang'olo. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Tsakatsenga miji mingi, na kakala na ng'ombe na ng'olo wengi, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakamwing'a mali nyingi. <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Mfalume Hezekia yuyo iyadiwile ghamatsi gha imbwibwi ya Gihoni, kaghahimbila lukolongo kaghaleka ghabite hasi kwa hasi mbaka ubali wa kulikuswela litsuwa wa ghumji ghwa Daudi. Hezekia tsakebweda mna chila chinu chayatendile. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Lekeni iwanu iwatumighwe na wakulu wa Babeli kuna yeye kumghutsa pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa ipfilawile amwo, Imulungu tsakamleka yelamlilile imweyegho, ili yamghetse na kumanya ghose ighali mmoyo mwake.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa utawala wa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:20-21">2 Wafal 20:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Aghala ghose ghangi ghayatendile mfalume Hezekia na aghala ighanoghile ghayatendile, ghandikighwa mna Ghamaono gha nabii Isaya, mwana wa Amosi na mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda na Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Kuya Hezekia kafa na katsikighwa hachidando ha ipfibaka pfa iwana wa Daudi. Wanu wose wa Yuda na wenyekaye wa Yerusalemu wamwing'a heshima ng'ulu ahala hayafile, naye Manase imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s">Manase kakuwa mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:20-21">2 Wafal 20:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manase tsakana miyaka kumi na mili hayawile mfalume wa Yuda, kawa mfalume ako Yerusalemu kwa miyaka hamsini na tano. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Katenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, tsakaigha ipfinu pfa ukudesa pfawatendile iwanu wa isi tsingi iwawingighwe na IMNDEWA hambele ha Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Katsitsenga keli tsimatsabau tsa hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi ipfimwaghighwe na Hezekia, aba wake, katsenga imatsabahu ya ukumtambika mulungu Baali, na kafina tsingutso tsa Ashera. Manase pfipfila kapfinamila na kupfitambikila ipfinu pfose pfa kulanga. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Katsenga matsabahu tsa ukutambikila milungu ingi mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ing'anda iyalongile IMNDEWA, “Mna Yerusalemu kuko iwanu watsolitambikila litaghwa lyangu matsuwa ghose.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Mna ipfibwalu pfose pfili pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, katsenga tsimatsabahu tsa ukutambikila ipfinu pfa kulanga. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Kawabititsa iwanaghe mna ghumoto wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa hana lwanda lwa mwana wa Hinomu. Katoa bau, kalaghula, kapfala tsifubalo; kuya kasang'ana na walaghutsi wa mitsimu na iwahawi. Katenda ghehile ghendo hambele ha IMNDEWA, na kumtenda yamwonele maya. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Kasola chinyagho chayafinile kachimitsa mna ing'anda, hanu IMNDEWA hayawalongele Daudi na imwanaghe Selemani apfino, “Mna ing'anda aino na mna Yerusalemu, nisaghula kulawa mna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli hawe hanu ha ukunitambikila taghwa lyangu matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Na ka iwanu wa Isiraeli watsotenda ghose ka pfaniwalaghitse, wang'akinda ghamalaghitso, imiko na malamtsi ghanimwing'ile Musa, sitsowaleka ghendo baye wawingighwe kulawa mna isi aino iyaniweng'ile wahenga wawo.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Lekeni Manase kawaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda na iwenyekaye wa Yerusalemu, kawalongotsa mna ukutenda ghehile ghendo kubita iwanu wa isi tsingi, awala IMNDEWA wayawawingile hambele ha iwanu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase komuyila Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Naye IMNDEWA kamkanya Manase na Iwanu wake, lekeni ng'awamtegheletse baye. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghalila pfilongotsi wa maasikali wa mfalume wa Ashuru. Pfilongotsi awo tsawamghogha Manase wamtobola imula na induwano, na wamwoha tsipingu tsa shaba, wamghala Babeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Hayakalile mna ghamaghayo, kamlomba IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, kehulumsa ghendo hambele ha Imulungu wa iwahenga wake. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Kamlomba ghendo, naye IMNDEWA kahulika ghayalombile, kamuyitsa Yerusalemu kuna ufalume wake. Baho Manase katanga ka IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Haghamalile agho, Manase katsenga ubanda ungi ubali wa kunze mwa ghumji ghwa Daudi, ubali wa kwalikuswela litsuwa wa Gihoni, mlwanda, kaughendelesa mbaka Lilango lya Wasomba, nawo utsunguluka mbaka chidunda cha ghamatuta, aho kawinula uchanya ghendo. Hamwe na agho, keka pfilongotsi wa maasikali mna imiji yose ya Yuda ili mna tsingome. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Kailapfa milungu yose ya chigheni na ipfinyagho mna Ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Pfipfila katsibomola tsimatsabahu itsitsengighwe kuna ichidunda cha Ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ako Yerusalemu, kuya kapfasa kunze mwa ghumji. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Kuya koyitsa imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA, na mchanya mwake kalapfa nambiko tsa ukala tseghamba na tsa ukumlongela Imulungu mighede, kawalaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda wamtammbikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Hata apfo iwanu waghendelela kulapfa nambiko hanu henulighwe, lekeni wamlapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo yaliyeka.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa Utawala wa Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Aghala ghose ghayatendile Manase, ghamalombi ghake kwa Imulungu wake na aghala ghawamlongele manabii kubitila taghwa lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, agho ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Ghamalombi ghake, na Imulungu pfayambokele, nzambi tsake na ukuleka kwake kuwa mwenyepfale, hanu hayatsengile ha ukutammbikila, na pfayatendile tsingutso tsa Ashera, na ipfinyagho, hayakalile ng'ana yoye baye kwa Imulungu, agho ghandikighwa mna kumbukumbu tsa manabii. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Manase kafa na katsikighwa mna ing'anda yake ya ufalume, naye Amoni, imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amoni kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2 Wafal 21:19-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amoni tsakana miyaka ishirini na mili hayanzile kutawala Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka pfayatendile Manase, aba wake. Kuya kalapfa nambiko tsa ukupfitambikila ipfinyagho pfayasongole Manase, aba wake. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Lekeni yeye ng'ehulumse baye hambele ha IMNDEWA ka pfayatendile Manase, ila yeye tsakongetsa ukutenda ghehile ghendo. <verse eid="2CH 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Hambele iwatumighwa wake wamtendela tsengwe, wamkoma mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Lekeni wanu wa Yuda wawakoma awo wose iwamtendele tsengwe Amoni; kuya wamtenda Yosia, imwanaghe yawe mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s">Yosia kakuwa mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2 Wafal 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Yosia tsakana miyaka minane hayanzile kutawala, katawala miyaka selasini na ghumwe aku kokala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Katenda ghanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA. Tsakawinza nzila tsa Daudi, sekulu wake na kakinda ghamalaghitso ghose gha Imulungu.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosia kohinya ipfinyagho pfa milungu ingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kane ghwa ufalume wake, hayang'ali kamsongolo, kanza ukumbama Imulungu wa Daudi, sekulu wake. Na hayakalile na miyaka kumi na mili kanza kuitenda Yuda na Yerusalemu yele kwa kutsihinya tsimatsabau tsa hanu henulighwe tsa ukutambikila milungu ingi, na kapfihinya ipfinyagho pfa Ashera na pfinyagho pfingi pfa ukusongola na pfa ukulubula. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Iwanu wake watsibomola tsimatsabahu tsa Mabaali, na matsabahu tsa ukudusulila upfumba itsikalile mchanya mwake, kuya katsihonda tsingutso tsa Ashera na pfinyagho pfingi pfa ukusongola, na katsidugha tsiwa timbwisi, nalyo litimbwisi kalighela mchanya mwa ipfibaka pfa iwanu iwapfilapfilile nambiko. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Pfipfila kailakatsa imipate ya iwatambika wa milungu ayo mna tsimatsabau tsawatambikile, kaitenda Yuda na yerusalemu yele. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Katenda apfo mna imiji ya Manase, Efuraimu, Simeoni, mbaka Naftari, na mna ghamahame ighatsunguluke imiji ayo. <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />Katsihonda honda tsimatsabahu na ngutso tsa Ashera mbaka tsiwa timbwisi. Kuya tsakaghanaghana tsimatsabahu tsa ukudusulila upfumba mna isi yose ya Isiraeli. Kuya koya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitabu cha Ghamalaghitso chakoneka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2 Wafal 22:3-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa ukutawala kwake, hayamalitse kuitenda isi na ing'anda yele katuma wanu wadatu, Shafani mwana wa Asalia, Maaseya mkulu wa ghumji, na Yoa, mwana wa Yoazi, imwandishi, ili waghende kuitsenga keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Awo wamghendela Hilikia mtambika mkulu, wamwing'a sendi itsighalighwe mna ing'anda ya Imulungu na Walawi iwakalitse ghamalango, tsawabokele kulawa kwa iwanu wa Manase, Efuraimu na kulawa mna isi yose ya Isiraeli, isi yose ya Yuda na Benjamini, na kulawa kwa wenyekaye wa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Weng'ighwa iwemilile isang'ano ya ukuitsenga ghoya keli ing'anda ya Imulungu na iwanu awo iwemilile wawaliha iwanu iwatsengile keli ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Kuya waweng'a tsisendi atso iwanu iwosongola mibiki na iwanu iwotsenga, tsiwe tsa ukughulila ghamabwe ighasongolighwe, na mbao tsa ukulumbila, na mighamba ya kutumila mna sang'ano ya ukutenda keli tsing'anda atsila itsilekighwe ka mahame na wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Iwanu awo watenda isang'ano ayo kwa ukotogholighwa, na wang'ali wolongotsighwa na Walawi wane, Yahati na Obadia, Walawi iwalawile mna ilukolo lwa Merari, na Zakaria na Meshulamu iwalawile mna ilukolo lwa Kohati. Walawi wose iwakubuhu mna ukutowa ipfinu pfa ukwimbila, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />tsawawemilila waduta mitsigho na kuwalongotsa wose iwatendile sang'ano tsingi. Walawi wamwenga tsawawa iwaandishi, na wakulu, na wamwenga wang'ali wokalitsa imilango. <verse eid="2CH 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Hawang'ali wolapfa kunze tsisendi itsighalighwe mna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, mtambika Hilikia kachona ichitabu cha Ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA ighalapfighwe kubitila Musa. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilikia kamlongela Shafania imwandishi, “Nichona ichitabu cha Ghamalaghitso mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.” Kuya Hilikia kamwing'a Shafani ichitabu acho. <verse eid="2CH 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Naye Shafani kamghalila mfalume, kuya kamlongela, “Ghose ghautulaghitse twetwe iwatumighwa tughatenda.” <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Tutsilapfa tsisendi itsikalile mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, kuya tuweng'a iwanu iwasang'ane na iwemilile ing'onde. <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Kuya Shefani kamlongela mfalume, “Mtambika Hilikia kangaya chitabu achino.” Naye Shafani kachisoma hambele ha mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Mfalume hayaulike pfagholonga ghamalaghitso ighali mna ichitabu acho, kadegha maghwanda ghake kwa wogha. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Kamlaghitsa mtambika Hilikia, na Ahikamu mwanaghe Shafani, na Akibori mwanaghe Mikaya hamwe na imwandishi Shafani na Asaya mtumighwa wa mfalume, kawalongela, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Mghende mkangutsile nene kwa IMNDEWA na mkawaghutsile iwanu wa Yuda aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu achino ichoneke. IMNDEWA katughudubukila kwaapfila iwahenga wetu ng'awategheletse baye ghamalonga gha ichitabu achino, na ng'awatendile baye aghala ighandikighwe twetwe tutende.” <verse eid="2CH 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Apfo Hilikia hamwe na awala iwatumighwe na mfalume wamghendela nabii yumwe pinga iyakemighwe Hulida, mwehe wa Tokati mwana wa Hasra, mlolesa ghamaghwanda ighatumike mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Yeye tsayang'ali yokala Yerusalemu mna ichijiji cha kabili, nawo walonga naye aghala ighalawile. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Naye pinga ayo kawalongela, Achino chicho chayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, namwe mlongeleni apfino imunu iyawatumile kuna nene, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Nitsoghala ghehile hanu ahano na mna iwanu wake, ka chila chinu ichandikighwe mna ichitabu acho chayasomile mfalume wa Yuda pfachilonga. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Kwaapfila wandema nene, na wadusula ubani kuna imilungu ingi na kunitenda nene nighudubuke kwa pfinyagho pfawatendile kwa ghamoko ghawo, imaya yangu itsakwaka hanu ahano, na kuduhu wa kuitsima. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Mlongeleni mfalume wa Yuda iyawatumile mwemwe mtse kuna nene mumghutse IMNDEWA, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli mna aghala ghauhulike. <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwako tsaghukutama na kwihulumsa hambele hangu nene MNDEWA ahala hauhulike apfila pfanihalongile hanu ahano na iwanu wake, ka wang'alighitighwe na kulekighwa mahame. Kwa ukudegha kwako ghamagwanda na ukulila kwaulilile nene nikutegheletsa, yolonga apfo IMNDEWA <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Sitsoghala baye ighehile agho hanu ahano mbaka ghweghwe hautsakufa na kutsikighwa, tsinenge tsako ng'atsitsakona baye ighehile ghanitsoghala hanu ahano.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosia kelaghana kumtegheletsa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:1-20">2 Wafal 23:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Kuya mfalume Yosia kawakema hamwe wanzehe wose wa Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Naye mfalume kaghenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA aku kelongotsa na wamale wose wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu, iwatambika na manabii, na iwanu wose wadodo kwa wabala. Kawasomela aghala ghose ighandikighwe mna ichitabu cha laghano, ichoneke mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Mfalume kema habehi na ingutso yake, keka laghano hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka katsomuwinza IMNDEWA, kwa ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake, imiko yake na ghamalamutsi ghake, kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose, ghumuhe ghwake ghwose, na katsotenda aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu acho cha lilaghano. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Kuya kawatenda iwanu wose iwakalile Yerusalemu na Benjamini watoghole kukinda lilaghano. Nawo iwenyekaye wa Yerusalemu pfipfio pfawatendile, wakala kwa kulikinda lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Pfipfila Yosia kapfilapfa ipfinyagho pfose ipfidesa ipfikalile mna Isiraeli yose, na kawakomangitsa iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wamtumikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo. Mna ugima wake wose ng'awamlekile baye IMNDEWA, Imulungu iwahenga wawo.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s">Yosia kodeng'elela ichihungo cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2 Wafal 23:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Mfalume Yosia kamtendela Pasaka IMNDEWA mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, wachinja wang'olo wa Pasaka mna litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Kawasaghula watambika iyawekile mna tsing'onde tsawo mna ing'anda ya Imulungu na kawaghuma ghumoyo watsitende pfinoghile. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Kuya kawalaghitsa Walawi iwang'ali wowafunda iwanu wa Isiraeli, iwaenzeluke hambele ha IMNDEWA, kawalongela, “Likeni lisanduku lienzeluke mna ing'anda iyaitsengile Selemani mwana wa Daudi, mfalume wa Isiraeli. Ng'ambamighwa baye kuliduta keli mna ghamayegha ghenu. Lelo mumtumikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na iwanu wake wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Hamsang'ana tsing'onde tsenu mwighole kwa kulola kolo tsenu, ka pfayandike Daudi, mfalume wa Isiraeli, na ka pfayandike Selemani imwanaghe. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Mwighole hamkwima hanu haenzeluke kwa kulola tsikolo tsenu tsamlawa ili chila lukolo lwa iwanu wa Isiraeli ludahe kwapfilighwa na yumwe wenu. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Muwachinje wang'olo wa Pasaka, mwitende mwele, kuya muwapfile ndughu tsenu, watende achila chayalongile IMNDEWA kubitila Musa.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Kuya Yosia kaweng'a iwanu wamene na wang'olo elfu salasini, na wang'ombe elufu ndatu, wawe wa nambiko ya Pasaka, wose awano tsawalapfighwa kulawa kuna imifugho yake imwenyegho. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Nawo iwakulu wake kwa ukubama wenyegho walapfa pfinu pfawo na waweng'a iwanu, watambika na Walawi. Hilikia, Zekaria na Yeieli iwakulu wa ing'anda ya Imulungu, waweng'a iwatambika wamene na iwang'olo elufu mbili na miya sita na wang'ombe mia ndatu wawe nambiko tsa Pasaka. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Naye Konania na ndughu tsake weli, Shemaya na Netaneli, hamwe na Hashabia, Yeieli na Yozabadi iwakalile pfilongotsi wa Walawi, nawo pfipfila waweng'a Walawi ng'olo na mene elufu tano, na ng'ombe miya tano, wawe nambiko tsa Pasaka. <verse eid="2CH 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Hawamalitse kutenda chila chinu kwa kuideng'elela Pasaka, iwatambika wema hanu hawo, na Walawi wema mna ghamakingili ghawo, ka pfayalaghitse mfalume. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Wawachinja wang'olo wa Pasaka, nawo iwatambika wamitsa idamu iwaibokele kulawa kuna wawo kuna imatsabahu, nawo Walawi wawahuna wanyama awo. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Kuya wabaghula wanyama iwalapfighwe wawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa ili waweng'e tsikolo natso tsimlapfile IMNDEWA ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha Musa. Tsawawatenda pfipfo kwa wang'ombe. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Wawabanika wanyama wa Pasaka mna ghumoto ka pfailaghitsighwe, na wayambika inyama ienzeluke mna ghamabigha, masufuria na mna tsinongo, kuya wasumka kuwagholela iwanu wose. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Hambele Walawi weyaanda iwenyegho na iwatambika, mana watambika lweleko lwa Aruni wang'ali wotenda sang'ano ya ukulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na tsa ghamapfuta mbaka nechilo, apfo Walawi weyandalila iwenyegho na ukuwaandalila watambika lweleko lwa Aruni. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Nawo iwanu iwakwimba, lweleko lwa Asafu, wema hanu hawo, ka pfayalaghitse mfalume Daudi, Asafu, Hemani na Yedutuni nabii wa mfalume. Nawo iwokalitsa ghamalango tsawakala hana ghamalango. Ng'awabamighwe baye kuleka sang'ano yawo, mana ndughu tsawo Walawi tsawawandalila Pasaka. <verse eid="2CH 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Chila chinu ichibamighwa kutendeka kwa ajili ya ichihungo cha Pasaka tsachitendeka mna litsuwa alyo, ili kudeng'elela Paska na kulapfa nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa hanu aho ukutambikila he IMNDEWA ka pfayalaghitse mfalume Yosia. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Waisiraeli iwakalile baho wadeng'elela Pasaka na chihungo cha ipfighate ifilihela hamila kwa matsuwa saba. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Tsang'ana wadeng'elele baye Paska ka aino kulawa ghamatsuwa gha nabii Samweli. Kuduhu mfalume hata yumwe wa Isiraeli, iyadeng'elele Paska ka aino iyaideng'elele mfalume Yosia hamwe na iwatambika, Walawi na iwanu wose wa Yuda, na Waisiraeli iwakalile baho na iwanu wa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Ipasaka ayo ideng'elelighwa mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa mfalume Yosia.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa utawala wa Yosia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:28-30">2 Wafal 23:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Agha ghose haghamalile, mfalume Yosia hayamalitse kuyika ghoya Ing'anda ya Imulungu, Neko mfalume wa Misiri kagheluka kuitowa Karikemishi, kuna ghumto Efurate. Naye mfalume Yosia kalawa kaghenda yaketowe naye. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Lekeni mfalume Neko katuma usenga iulonga, “Ng'ondo aino si yako baye, mfalume wa Yuda. Sitsile baye kwitowa naghwe, ila nitsa kwitowa na maaduwi tsangu, na Imulungu kandaghitsa nisumke ukuwatowa, lelo uleke kulema chayolonga Imulungu iyali hamwe na nene, hela katsokukoma.” <verse eid="2CH 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Lekeni Yosia ng'atoghole baye kumleka hela. Kalema kutegheletsa chayalongile Imulungu kubitila Neko, apfo kapfala maghwanda ghangi yaleke kumanyika ka mfalume, kuya kaghenda kwitowa mna ichiwala cha Megido. <verse eid="2CH 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Nawo iwakwasa imishale wamwasila mfalume Yosia ghumshale, baho mfalume Yosia kawalongela iwatumighwa wake, “Mnilapfe ahano! Nilaghighwa pfihile.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Watumighwa wake wamlapfa mna ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi kuya wamdinitsa mna ghumtuka ghungi na woka naye mbaka Yerusalemu, ako kafa, wamtsika mna ipfibaka pfa iwahenga wake. Iwanu wose wa Yuda na Yerusalemu wamdomboketsela Yosia <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Nabii Yeremiya kamwimbila wila wa kumlilila Yosia. Tangiya baho mbaka leloli iwamale na mapinga wose womtambula Yosia hawakwimba wila awo. Chinu achino chiwa chihendo mna isi ya Isiraeli na wila awo wandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukudomboketsa. <verse eid="2CH 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Aghala ghose ghayatendile Yosia na ighanoghile ghayatendile ka pfaghandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />na ghose ghayatendile kulawa hayanzile mbaka hayamalitse, ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu tsa wafalume wa Isiraeli na Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s">Yehoahazi kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:30-35">2 Wafal 23:30-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Wanu wa Yuda wamsola Yehoahazi, mwana wa Yosia, wamwika yawe mfalume, yasole hanu ha aba wake. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehoahazi tsakana miyaka ishirini na midatu hayanzile kutawala, katawala miyetsi midatu aku kokala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Hambele mfalume wa Misiri kamghogha Yehoahazi kawalaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda walihe kodi ya ghamabwe gha pfetsa kilo elufu ndatu na miya nne na nzahabu kilo salasini na nne. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Kuya mfalume Neko wa Misiri kamwika Eliakimu, ndughu yake Yosia, yawe mfalume hanu ha aba wake, na kamwing'a taghwa lingi, kamkema Yehoyakimu. Mfalume Neko kamsola Yehoahazi kamghala Misiri.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakimu kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2 Wafal 23:36–24:7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehoyakimu tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayanzile kutawala, katawala kwa miyaka kumi na ghumwe aku kokala Yerusalemu. Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebukadineza mfalume wa Babeli, kampfamila, kamwoha na minyololo ya shaba na kamghala Babeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Kuya Nebukadineza kasola ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu, kapfighala Babeli na kapfika mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume ako Babeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Aghala ghose ghayatendile Yehoyakimu, hamwe na pfinu pfa ukudesa pfayatendile, na ghehile ghayatendile ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli na Yuda. Yehoyakini imwanaghe kawa mfalume, kasola hanu ha aba wake.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakini kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2 Wafal 24:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehoyakini tsakana miyaka kumi na minane hayanzile kutawala, katawala aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa meyetsi midatu na matsuwa kumi. Katenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Ghumwaka haghumalile, mfalume Nebukadneza katuma wanu wakamghoghe Yehoyakini, na wamghala Babeli, woya hamwe na ipfinu pfa bei ng'ulu pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Kuya kamwika Zedekia, ndughu yake Yehoyakini, yawe mfalume wa Yuda na Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zedekia kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Wafal 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3">Yere 52:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedekia tsakana miyaka ishirini na ghumwe hayanzile kutawala, katawala aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na ghumwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Katenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, wala ng'ehulumse baye hambele ha nabii Yeremia iyalongile ghamalonga igholawa kwa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2CH 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalemu yohinyighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:1-21">2 Wafal 25:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3-11">Yere 52:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Zedekia pfipfila kambiduka mfalume Nebukadneza iyamtendile yelahe kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA ka ng'atsombiduka baye. Zedekia kawa msughu na ghumoyo mkomu, kalema kumhundukila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Pfilongotsi wa watambika na pfilongotsi wa iwanu, na iwanu wenyegho, wose waleka ghendo kuwa wanu wakutogholeka, waigha ighehile ghawatendile iwanu wa isi tsingi; apfo waitenda ing'anda ya Imulungu yoneke iha, iyaitendile yeye imwenyegho ienzeluke ako Yerualemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo, yang'ali yowatumagha iwasenga wake kuna wawo, kwaapfila yeye kana libatsi kwa iwanu wake na kwa ing'anda yake. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Lekeni wawo waghendelela kuwabetsa wasenga wa Imulungu, ng'awategheletse tsimbuli tsake baye, kuya wawaseka manabii wake mbaka maya ya IMNDEWA iwahulumkila wanu wake, nawo ng'awadahile baye kuhepa. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Apfo IMNDEWA kamghala mfalume wa Babeli iyawakomile iwasongolo wawo kwa limaghe mbaka mghati mwa hanu haenzeluka, wala ng'amwonele baye libatsi munu wowose, yawe msongolo au mwali, mnzehe au chikongwe. IMNDEWA kawaleka waghoghighwe na Nebukadneza. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Kapfisola ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu, pfikulu na pfidodo na ipfinu ipfikalile mna ipfiheloto pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na apfila pfa ing'anda ya mfalume na iwakulu wake. Pfose kapfighala Babeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Kailakatsa ing'anda ya Imulungu, kaubomola ubanda wa Yerusalemu, katsilakatsa tsing'anda tsose tsa chifalume, na kapfihinya ipfinu pfake pfose pfa bei ng'ulu. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Iwanu iwahonile kawaghogha na kawaghala Babeli. Ako wawa watumwa wake na wa iwanaghe mbaka ufalume wa Uajemi hawanzile kutawala. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Apfo chilawila achila chayalongile IMNDEWA kubitila Yeremia, “Isi itsokala hela bila kulimighwa kwa miyaka sabini kuliha ghamatsuwa ghose isi haikalile bila kudeng'elela Isabato.”<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koreshi Kowalaghitsa Waajemi Woye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Ezr 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Mna ghumwaka wa mwanduso ghwa ufalume wa Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi, ili itimile imbuli ya IMNDEWA iyalongile kubitila nabii Yeremia, IMNDEWA kaghulamsa ghumoyo ghwa Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi, naye kalaghitsa mna ufalume wake wose, kuya kaghala tsimbuli atso kwa kutsandika apfino, <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi, ‘IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa kulanga, kangaya tsifalume tsose tsa iisi tsose, kuya kanilaghitsa nimtsengele ing'anda ako Yerusalemu, mna isi ya Yuda. Lelo chila munu mna mwemwe wose imli wanu wake IMNDEWA, na yoke, na Imulungu yawe hamwe naye.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>